      "section": "complete-source / Compiling 7-Zip for Unix/Linux",
      "contract": "DISABLE_RAR_COMPRESS=1 allows to exclude such \"not-fully-free\" RAR code from compilation. if DISABLE_RAR_COMPRESS=1 is specified, 7-zip will not be able to decompress files from rar archives, but 7-zip still will be able to open rar archives to get list of files or to extract files that are stored without compression. if DISABLE_RAR=1 is specified, 7-zip will not be able to work with RAR archives.",
