# Full archive feature inventory — original 7-Zip 26.04

Generated 2026-10-12T16:17:55.036879+00:00. This inventory contains 3,396 source-backed atoms from 70 English manual pages, seven SDK technical documents, package readmes, selected current source declarations and the executed complete/Extra/SDK registries. The JSON preserves release, edition, platform, hashes, line ranges, candidate status and executable acceptance ideas.

The official complete Windows x64 installer, complete sources and LZMA SDK were downloaded and matched publisher SHA-256 values. Existing official Extra and 7zr assets were copied into this independent baseline and matched the same release metadata. The installer was extracted without installation. Project 08 previously studied only a reduced Extra DLL property export.

The complete installer and Extra package contain identical 7-zip.chm bytes. Their shared manual is broader than the Extra engine. Complete 7z.exe + 7z.dll, Extra 7za.exe, Extra 7za.dll/7zxa.dll, SDK 7zr and the SDK C decoder are distinct bindings. Original GUI and shell behavior remain unexercised.

