## Coverage and qualifications

One atom per functional table row, expanded format direction or keyboard modifier, option declaration, list statement, paragraph sentence, syntax block, SDK technical/API statement, selected current SDK declaration or executed registry row. Repeated appearances are retained. Raw examples are indexed separately.

This covers the documented corpus under that rule. It does not claim all undocumented code paths, ABI declarations or option combinations have been enumerated. Some rows and dependent clauses require finer test-case splitting. Licensing, acknowledgements and history files are preserved; they do not add functional acceptance atoms.

Older embedded documents need adjudication against current source: 7zC identifies 9.35, installer identifies 9.38, lzma identifies 24.07, 7zFormat identifies 18.06 and the LZMA specification is a draft dated 2015-06-14. The JSON records concrete old/current SDK discrepancies. The manual performance table compares 7-Zip 9.35 and WinRAR 5.20. It does not establish 26.04 performance.

