| 7Z26-01301 | Benchmark | The most important things for that test are: branch misprediction penalty (the length of pipeline) and the latencies of 32-bit instructions ("multiply", "shift", "add", "conditional move" and other). | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L45](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/benchmark.htm:45) |
