| 7Z26-01303 | Benchmark | You can set the big value for dictionary size and big number of passes to check RAM and CPU for reliability. | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L51](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/benchmark.htm:51) |
| 7Z26-01304 | Benchmark | If the benchmark shows some error message, in most cases it means that RAM of that system is defective. | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L51](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/benchmark.htm:51) |
