| 7Z26-01564 | Add to Archive Dialog Box / How to call this dialog box / Parameters / Compression method | LZMA \| It's base compression method for 7z format. Even old versions of 7-Zip can decompress archives created with LZMA method. It provides high compression ratio and very fast decompression. | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L56](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/plugins/7-zip/add.htm:56) |
| 7Z26-01565 | Add to Archive Dialog Box / How to call this dialog box / Parameters / Compression method | LZMA2 \| Default compression method of 7z format. LZMA2 is LZMA-based compression method. It provides better multithreading support than LZMA. But compression ratio can be worse in some cases. For best compression ratio with LZMA2 use 1 or 2 CPU threads. If you use LZMA2 with more than 2 threads, 7-zip splits data to chunks and compresses these chunks independently (2 threads per each chunk). | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L59](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/plugins/7-zip/add.htm:59) |
| 7Z26-01566 | Add to Archive Dialog Box / How to call this dialog box / Parameters / Compression method | PPMd \| Dmitry Shkarin's PPMdH algorithm with small changes. Usually it provides high compression ratio and high speed for text files. | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L64](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/plugins/7-zip/add.htm:64) |
| 7Z26-01567 | Add to Archive Dialog Box / How to call this dialog box / Parameters / Compression method | BZip2 \| Standard compression method based on BWT algorithm. Usually it provides high speed and pretty good compression ratio for text files. | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L67](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/plugins/7-zip/add.htm:67) |
| 7Z26-01568 | Add to Archive Dialog Box / How to call this dialog box / Parameters / Compression method | Deflate \| Standard compression method of ZIP and GZip formats. Compression ratio is not too high. But it provides pretty fast compressing and decompressing. Deflate method supports only 32 KB dictionary. | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L70](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/plugins/7-zip/add.htm:70) |
| 7Z26-01569 | Add to Archive Dialog Box / How to call this dialog box / Parameters / Compression method | Deflate64 \| Modified version of Deflate algorithm with bigger dictionary (64KB). | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L74](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/plugins/7-zip/add.htm:74) |
