| 7Z26-01572 | Add to Archive Dialog Box / How to call this dialog box / Parameters / Dictionary size | Usually, a higher Dictionary size gives a higher compression ratio. | GUI_contract_unimplemented; original_GUI_behavior_not_exercised | [L82](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/fm/plugins/7-zip/add.htm:82) |
