| 7Z26-01836 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? | Yes, 7-Zip is free software. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L14](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:14) |
| 7Z26-01837 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? | You can use it on any computer. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L14](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:14) |
| 7Z26-01838 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? | You don't need to register or pay for 7-Zip. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L14](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:14) |
| 7Z26-01839 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? | You must run 7-Zip File Manager in administrator mode. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L18](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:18) |
| 7Z26-01840 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? | Right-click the icon of 7-Zip File Manager, and then click Run as administrator. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L18](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:18) |
| 7Z26-01841 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? | Then you can change file associations and some other options. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L18](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:18) |
| 7Z26-01842 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | New versions of 7-Zip (starting from version 15.06) use another file sorting order by default for solid 7z archives. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L24](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:24) |
| 7Z26-01843 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | Old version of 7-Zip (before version 15.06) used file sorting "by type" ("by extension"). | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L27](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:27) |
| 7Z26-01844 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | New version of 7-Zip supports two sorting orders: | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L28](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:28) |
| 7Z26-01845 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | sorting by name - default order. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L30](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:30) |
| 7Z26-01846 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | sorting by type, if 'qs' is specified in Parameters field in "Add to archive" window, (or -mqs switch for command line version). | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L31](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:31) |
| 7Z26-01847 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | You can get big difference in compression ratio for different sorting methods, if dictionary size is smaller than total size of files. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L35](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:35) |
| 7Z26-01848 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | If there are similar files in different folders, the sorting "by type" can provide better compression ratio in some cases. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L35](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:35) |
| 7Z26-01849 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | Note that sorting "by type" has some drawbacks. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L40](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:40) |
| 7Z26-01850 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | For example, NTFS volumes use sorting order "by name", so if an archive uses another sorting, then the speed of some operations for files with unusual order can fall on HDD devices (HDDs have low speed for "seek" operations). | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L40](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:40) |
| 7Z26-01851 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | You can increase compression ratio with the following methods: | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L45](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:45) |
| 7Z26-01852 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | Increase dictionary size. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L47](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:47) |
| 7Z26-01853 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | It can help when 'qs' is not used. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L47](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:47) |
| 7Z26-01854 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | Specify 'qs' in Parameters field (or use -mqs switch for command line version). | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L48](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:48) |
| 7Z26-01855 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why 7z archives created by new version of 7-Zip can be larger than archives created by old version of 7-Zip? | If you think that unusual file order is not problem for you, and if better compression ratio with small dictionary is more important for you, use 'qs' mode. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L51](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:51) |
| 7Z26-01856 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why can't 7-Zip open some ZIP archives? | In 99% of these cases it means that the archive contains incorrect headers. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L56](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:56) |
| 7Z26-01857 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why can't 7-Zip open some ZIP archives? | Other ZIP programs can open some archives with incorrect headers, since these programs just ignore errors. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L56](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:56) |
| 7Z26-01858 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why can't 7-Zip open some ZIP archives? | If you have such archive, please don't call the 7-Zip developers about it. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L59](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:59) |
| 7Z26-01859 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why can't 7-Zip open some ZIP archives? | Instead try to find the program that was used to create the archive and inform the developers of that program that their software is not ZIP-compatible. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L59](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:59) |
| 7Z26-01860 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why can't 7-Zip open some ZIP archives? | There are also some ZIP archives that were encoded with methods unsupported by 7-Zip, for example, WAVPack (WinZip). | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L63](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:63) |
| 7Z26-01861 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why does drag-and-drop archive extraction from 7-Zip to Explorer use temp files? | 7-Zip doesn't know folder path of drop target. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L67](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:67) |
| 7Z26-01862 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why does drag-and-drop archive extraction from 7-Zip to Explorer use temp files? | Only Windows Explorer knows exact drop target. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L67](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:67) |
| 7Z26-01863 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why does drag-and-drop archive extraction from 7-Zip to Explorer use temp files? | And Windows Explorer needs files (drag source) as decompressed files on disk. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L67](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:67) |
| 7Z26-01864 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why does drag-and-drop archive extraction from 7-Zip to Explorer use temp files? | So 7-Zip extracts files from archive to temp folder and then 7-Zip notifies Windows Explorer about paths of these temp files. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L67](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:67) |
| 7Z26-01865 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why does drag-and-drop archive extraction from 7-Zip to Explorer use temp files? | Then Windows Explorer copies these files to drop target folder. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L67](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:67) |
| 7Z26-01866 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why does drag-and-drop archive extraction from 7-Zip to Explorer use temp files? | To avoid temp file usage, you can use Extract command of 7-Zip or drag-and-drop from 7-Zip to 7-Zip. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L74](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:74) |
| 7Z26-01867 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why doesn't the command line version add files without extensions to an archive? | You're probably using a *.* wildcard. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L78](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:78) |
| 7Z26-01868 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why doesn't the command line version add files without extensions to an archive? | 7-Zip doesn't use the operating system's wildcard mask parser, and consequently treats *.* as any file that has an extension. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L78](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:78) |
| 7Z26-01869 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why doesn't the command line version add files without extensions to an archive? | To process all files you must use the * wildcard instead or omit the wildcard altogether. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L78](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:78) |
| 7Z26-01870 | Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ) / Can I use 7-Zip in a commercial organization? / How can I set file associations to 7-Zip in Windows 7 and Windows Vista? / Why doesn't -r switch work as expected? | In most cases you don't need -r switch. | not_implemented_or_unverified | [L83](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/manual/general/faq.htm:83) |
