| 7Z26-02148 | lzma-sdk.txt / Recommendations | To increase the compression ratio for LZMA compressing it's desirable to have aligned data (if it's possible) and also it's desirable to locate data in such order, where code is grouped in one place and data is grouped in other place (it's better than such mixing: code, data, code, data, ...). | SDK_ABI_not_exposed; conditional_SDK_requirement_not_a_GUI_requirement | [L392](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/sdk-source/DOC/lzma-sdk.txt:392) |
