| 7Z26-02150 | lzma-sdk.txt / Filters | For example, it's possible to increase the compression ratio on 5-10% for code for those CPU ISAs: x86, IA-64, ARM, ARM-Thumb, PowerPC, SPARC. | SDK_ABI_not_exposed; conditional_SDK_requirement_not_a_GUI_requirement | [L401](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/sdk-source/DOC/lzma-sdk.txt:401) |
