| 7Z26-02464 | lzma-specification.txt / lzma file format | void DecodeProperties(const Byte *properties) { unsigned d = properties[0]; if (d >= (9 * 5 * 5)) throw "Incorrect LZMA properties"; lc = d % 9; d /= 9; pb = d / 5; lp = d % 5; dictSizeInProperties = 0; for (int i = 0; i < 4; i++) dictSizeInProperties \|= (UInt32)properties[i + 1] << (8 * i); dictSize = dictSizeInProperties; if (dictSize < LZMA_DIC_MIN) dictSize = LZMA_DIC_MIN; } | SDK_ABI_not_exposed; conditional_SDK_requirement_not_a_GUI_requirement | [L65](C:/Users/evanh/Documents/Codex/2026-10-12/go/work/full-archive-baseline-20261012/sdk-source/DOC/lzma-specification.txt:65) |
