      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Assistant UI runs in your self-hosted Grafana deployment. The Assistant backend, usage limits, and billing stay in the Grafana Cloud stack that you connect during setup. If you run Grafana OSS or Grafana Enterprise, this is the supported way to use Assistant outside Grafana Cloud.",
