      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Otherwise, you can specify full path to the binary. For example, `/usr/share/grafana/bin/grafana` on Linux and `C:\\Program Files\\GrafanaLabs\\grafana\\bin\\grafana.exe` on Windows.",
