      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "`--pluginsDir value` overrides the path to where your local Grafana instance stores plugins. Use this option if you want to install, update, or remove a plugin somewhere other than the default directory (\"/var/lib/grafana/plugins\") [$GF_PLUGIN_DIR].",
