      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, you can use it to redirect logging to another file (maybe to log plugin installations in Grafana Cloud) or when resetting the admin password and you have non-default values for some important configuration value (like where the database is located).",
      "headingPath": [
