      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The logfmt transformation only requires specifying the input field name if you would like the transformation to apply to a different field than the results field. Example output variables for field = “host=srv001 endpoint=/test app=foo”:",
