      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.81faef572dd973529025",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After you create the copy, update your dashboards, panels, and alert rules to query the new data source. Existing queries continue to use the provisioned data source until you point them at the copy.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Provisioned data sources",
        "Create an editable copy of a provisioned data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 100,
        "lineEnd": 100,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L100-L100"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e1bbd1d31b4b4f4406d1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The copy is independent of the provisioned data source. Later changes to the provisioned data source, such as credential rotations or URL updates, don't propagate to your copy. Update the copy manually if the backend configuration changes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Provisioned data sources",
        "Create an editable copy of a provisioned data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 103,
        "lineEnd": 103,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L103-L103"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5b4d18a58c3b7ff24908",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you enable query and resource caching, Grafana temporarily stores the results of data source queries and resource requests. When you or another user submit the same query or resource request again, the results will come back from the cache instead of from the data source.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 108,
        "lineEnd": 108,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L108-L108"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7bf5c404fbbbecc9ed38",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When using Grafana, a query pertains to a request for data frames to be modified or displayed. A resource relates to any HTTP requests made by a plugin, such as the Amazon Timestream plugin requesting a list of available databases from AWS. For more information on data source queries and resources, please see the developers page on [backend plugins](https://grafana.com/developers/plugin-tools/key-concepts/backend-plugins/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.69f410cfbfa7ba8dd456",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The caching feature works for **all** backend data sources. You can enable the cache globally in Grafana's [configuration](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/#caching), and configure a cache duration (also called Time to Live, or TTL) for each data source individually.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 112,
        "lineEnd": 112,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L112-L112"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.27fd634e9f2468f39ab9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Storing cached queries in-memory can increase Grafana's memory footprint. In production environments, a Redis or Memcached backend is highly recommended.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 121,
        "lineEnd": 121,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L121-L121"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.85a3ebc9d3c5b995d4bb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a panel queries a data source with cached data, it will either fetch fresh data or use cached data depending on the panel's **interval.** The interval is used to round the query time range to a nearby cached time range, increasing the likelihood of cache hits. Therefore, wider panels and dashboards with shorter time ranges fetch new data more often than narrower panels and dashboards with longer time ranges.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 124,
        "lineEnd": 124,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L124-L124"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.21ac650716b2429cd270",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A panel's interval is visible in the [query options](../../panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/). It is calculated as follows: `time range / max data points`. Max data points are calculated based on the width of the panel. For example, a wide panel with `1000 data points` on a dashboard with a time range of `last 7 days` will retrieve fresh data every 10 minutes: `7d / 1000 = 10m`. In this example, cached data for this panel will be served for up to 10 minutes before Grafana needs to query the data source again for new data.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 126,
        "lineEnd": 126,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L126-L126"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.acff20dd1d7597d06a59",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure a panel to retrieve data more often by increasing the **Max data points** setting in the panel's [query options](../../panels-visualizations/query-transform-data/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 128,
        "lineEnd": 128,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L128-L128"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d16293efd71eb61a47dc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By reducing the number of queries and requests sent to data sources, caching can provide the following benefits:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching",
        "Caching benefits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 132,
        "lineEnd": 132,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L132-L132"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9d5b32658b9b12fadf98",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Faster dashboard load times, especially for popular dashboards.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Data source management",
        "Query and resource caching",
        "Caching benefits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "48e0cd06582ded6e67389dc4fe82510ea7271f7b",
        "sha256": "087e0c6f2fdd1b21672ed0be96bcf714c87e35ca1887c2f4bb4382f0c4b4bdad",
        "lineStart": 134,
        "lineEnd": 134,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/_index.md#L134-L134"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
