      "id": "grafana.candidate.169a5e77b315ac79a83b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To verify that a data source works with query caching, follow the [instructions below](#enable-and-configure-query-caching) to **Enable and Configure query caching**. If caching is enabled in Grafana but the Caching tab is not visible for the given data source, then query caching is not available for that data source.",
