      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Traces**: Control access to spans using attribute selectors with resource scope attributes such as `resource.service.name` or `resource.env`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Label Based Access Control (LBAC) for data sources",
        "Logs, metrics, and traces filtering with LBAC"
      ],
      "source": {
