      "id": "grafana.candidate.da4383428cf4fa276d4f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- For Tempo and Cloud Traces, LBAC is available only at the team level. Data source-level LBAC rules, configured through cloud access policies, aren't supported for traces. Rules are restricted to resource scope attributes.",
