    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f2ada8b6f451692075b3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "It's recommended that you create a single data source for using LBAC for data sources rules so you have a clear separation of data sources using LBAC for data sources and those that aren't. All teams should have with only teams having `query` permission. You should create another data source configured without LBAC for data sources for full access.",
