      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To set up LBAC for data sources for a data source, refer to [Configure LBAC for data sources](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-loki/).",
