      "sourceText": "For more information on how to setup LBAC for data sources rules for a Loki data source, refer to [Create LBAC for data sources rules for the Loki data source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/create-teamlbac-rules/).",
