    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5a898ab6b3761cfe32b4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You cannot configure LBAC rules for Grafana-provisioned data sources from the UI. We recommend that you replicate the setting of the provisioned data source in a new data source as described in [LBAC Configuration for new Prometheus data source](#task-1-lbac-configuration-for-new-prometheus-data-source) and then add the LBAC configuration to the new data source.",
