      "id": "grafana.candidate.65b8b27041627a033285",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information on how to setup LBAC for data sources rules for a Prometheus data source, refer to [Create LBAC for data sources rules for the Prometheus data source](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/create-teamlbac-rules/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure LBAC for data sources for Prometheus data source",
        "Task 1: LBAC Configuration for new Prometheus data source"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-prometheus/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f10a66436815dbebdace076853abadc695538459",
        "sha256": "44cddb17eedccd4fbdfa2ac769d074632ef72f38f1770f31d20cbf0aa5a37ffa",
        "lineStart": 88,
        "lineEnd": 88,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-prometheus/index.md#L88-L88"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.677edbe0751c31552ee0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Team label-based access control (LBAC) for Cloud Traces or Tempo lets you restrict which spans teams can access by defining rules using trace attributes. LBAC provides fine-grained, team-based access control within a single tenant and mirrors the experience used for logs and metrics LBAC in Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team label-based access control for Tempo or Cloud Traces"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8bcf7e07e8b3dd4372824807b857bdf07f5e8b69",
        "sha256": "f0722a9a37983f751560bd95f6c782d8f0771fbf1d8351d9fca0c1c9a47f8d63",
        "lineStart": 19,
        "lineEnd": 19,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md#L19-L19"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.984a63e2907818133479",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Unlike logs and metrics, which also support data source-level LBAC through cloud access policies, traces LBAC is currently available only at the team level.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team label-based access control for Tempo or Cloud Traces"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8bcf7e07e8b3dd4372824807b857bdf07f5e8b69",
        "sha256": "f0722a9a37983f751560bd95f6c782d8f0771fbf1d8351d9fca0c1c9a47f8d63",
        "lineStart": 22,
        "lineEnd": 22,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md#L22-L22"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6f024557cab9f4ab7c7b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana uses the term LBAC as an umbrella term for label-based access control for all data sources. Traces use **attributes**, not labels, for access control, but the Grafana UI surfaces this functionality as LBAC for consistency.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team label-based access control for Tempo or Cloud Traces"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8bcf7e07e8b3dd4372824807b857bdf07f5e8b69",
