        "lineStart": 25,
        "lineEnd": 26,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md#L25-L26"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5ec7900d047fe2b959bf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This feature only applies to Grafana Cloud Traces, specifically, the Cloud-provisioned tracing data source.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team label-based access control for Tempo or Cloud Traces"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8bcf7e07e8b3dd4372824807b857bdf07f5e8b69",
        "sha256": "f0722a9a37983f751560bd95f6c782d8f0771fbf1d8351d9fca0c1c9a47f8d63",
        "lineStart": 28,
        "lineEnd": 28,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md#L28-L28"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d9667fcc8e4dbd8208ba",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a user queries tracing data source, Grafana evaluates the user’s team memberships and the LBAC rules assigned to those teams. These rules are added to the request so the Cloud Traces data source returns only permitted spans or attributes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure team label-based access control for Tempo or Cloud Traces",
        "How LBAC works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/data-source-management/teamlbac/configure-teamlbac-for-tempo/index.md",
