    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9fcfcc8e7763e6a0c2b8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "One common use case for creating an LBAC policy is to grant access to logs or metrics with a specific label. For example, you can create a label policy that includes all log lines or metrics with the label `namespace`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create LBAC for data source rule",
