      "id": "grafana.candidate.8dd89f0540761d7fe50a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Locate your current `license.jwt` file. In a standard installation it is stored inside the Grafana data directory, which on a typical Linux installation is in `/var/lib/grafana/data`. This location might be overridden in the ini file [Configuration](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/).",
