      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- When you reach the maximum number of active users, only currently active users (users who have signed in over the past 30 days) can sign in. When a new user or a previously-inactive user tries to sign in, the user will see an error message indicating that Grafana has reached its license limit.",
