    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b529fc4dd0c067acec26",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you have multiple production instances, your licensed users form a shared pool. You divide the total number of users across your production instances rather than receiving the full user count on each one.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Active users limit",
        "User allocation across production instances"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 240,
        "lineEnd": 240,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L240-L240"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cbe4e98593f7c6a137ba",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if your contract includes 3 production instances and 180 total users, you could allocate 60 users per instance, or 100 on one instance and 40 on each of the other 2. You aren't licensed for 180 active users on each instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Active users limit",
        "User allocation across production instances"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 242,
        "lineEnd": 242,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L242-L242"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5e6407348a5e8ae9fd2b",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Users are counted separately on each production instance where they're active. If the same user signs in to 2 production instances, that user counts once on each instance, consuming 2 users from your total allocation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Active users limit",
        "User allocation across production instances"
      ],
      "source": {
