    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a286e5031a4f1f676b02",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**License expiration date:** The license includes an expiration date, which is the date when a license becomes inactive.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 265,
        "lineEnd": 265,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L265-L265"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f15d7653e48d28a27e6f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As the license expiration date approaches, you will see a banner in Grafana that encourages you to renew. To learn about how to renew your license and what happens in Grafana when a license expires, refer to [License expiration](#license-expiration).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 267,
        "lineEnd": 267,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L267-L267"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.527ecec8925f2b8d1ff8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**License token expiration:** Grafana Enterprise requires a valid token, which is automatically renewed.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 269,
        "lineEnd": 269,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L269-L269"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3103a6db359530472ba4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A license token is a digital key that activates your license. By default, the license token is renewed every 24 hours by calling the Grafana API. Short-lived license tokens enable more frequent validation that licenses are compliant, and allow for more frequent license updates - for example, adding users or invalidating a compromised license.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 271,
        "lineEnd": 271,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L271-L271"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.41826bbdf4db60dfd2f7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "License token renewal requires internet access, and requires that the `auto_refresh_license` [configuration setting](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/enterprise-configuration/#auto_refresh_license) be set to `true`. If your Grafana Enterprise instance cannot connect to the internet, contact your Grafana Labs account team for additional options for token renewal and license audit.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 275,
        "lineEnd": 275,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L275-L275"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7c4d08b4be6d956bdca7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The License URL is the complete URL of your Grafana instance, for example `https://grafana.your-company.com/`. It is defined in the [root_url](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#root_url) configuration setting.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 279,
        "lineEnd": 279,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L279-L279"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b3cd9c83320c17631c9f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "**Concurrent sessions limit**: As of Grafana Enterprise 7.5, users can initiate up to three concurrent sessions of Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 281,
        "lineEnd": 281,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L281-L281"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.19dbc0d53b6f401fc702",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The system creates a session when a user signs in to Grafana from a new device, a different browser, or an incognito window. If a user signs in to Grafana from another tab or window within the same browser, only one session is used.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 283,
        "lineEnd": 283,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L283-L283"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.57d394fd88db2a59efb2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a user reaches the session limit, the fourth connection succeeds and the longest inactive session is signed out.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Additional license restrictions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 285,
        "lineEnd": 285,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L285-L285"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Additional license restrictions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ccf693e006f0212a1dd1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To increase the number of licensed users within Grafana, extend a license, or change your licensed URL, contact [Grafana support](/profile/org#support) or your Grafana Labs account team. They will update your license, which you can activate from within Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Grafana Enterprise license restrictions",
        "Request a change to your license"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 289,
        "lineEnd": 289,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L289-L289"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Grafana Enterprise license restrictions > Request a change to your license"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1a8057f01e5997c9088a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Standard Grafana Enterprise licenses include a certain number of seats that can be used, and prevent more users logging into Grafana than have been licensed. This makes sense if you prefer a predictable bill. It can however be a problem if you anticipate uneven usage patterns over time or when it's critical that no user ever be prevented from logging in to Grafana due to capacity constraints.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Usage billing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3f209b4f6d26e8686e726eeaaed3d61652d34061",
        "sha256": "9717448c8bca522a70657832fd68c57dc91d7d88d2dd5a0964173e72250aa58b",
        "lineStart": 295,
        "lineEnd": 295,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md#L295-L295"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ],
        "restriction": "Grafana Enterprise license > Usage billing"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b2a173ee92c0047654a6",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For those use-cases we support usage-based billing, where your license includes a certain number of included users and you are billed on a monthly basis for any excess active users during the month.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Enterprise license",
        "Usage billing"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/enterprise-licensing/_index.md",
