      "sourceText": "To retrieve your license, Grafana Enterprise requires access to your AWS account and license information. To grant access, create an IAM user in AWS with access to the license, and pass its credentials as environment variables on the host or container where Grafana is running. These environment variables allow Grafana to retrieve license details from AWS.",
