      "sourceText": "| Automated      | The Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant                                 | Generally available in Grafana v12 and available in public preview from Grafana v11.2 to v11.6 using the `onPremToCloudMigrations` feature toggle. This toggle is enabled by default in Grafana v11.5 and later. | <ul><li>Dashboards</li><li>Folders</li><li>Data sources</li><li>App Plugins</li><li>Panel Plugins</li><li>Library Panels</li><li>Grafana Alerting resources</li></ul> |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "360c505f17bcb0fc46cf919a31ac4bbbba61d5a9",
        "sha256": "1a7f11751d255b4dc53a15f27295a5cea2e8d2e9e467e8c2002d0e7e8342b169",
        "lineStart": 23,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/_index.md#L23-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
