      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana Enterprise, the server administrator has access to the migration assistant by default. You can also grant access to other Admins using a role-based access control (RBAC) role that enables other admins on the Grafana instance to view, build snapshots, and upload resources to Grafana Cloud.",
