    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.71ae668b3ba7b54bce0f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The migration assistant currently supports a subset of all resources available in Grafana. Refer to [Supported Resources](#supported-resources) for more details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Snapshots created by the migration assistant"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 151,
        "lineEnd": 151,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L151-L151"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Snapshots created by the migration assistant"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fdfb4a911d5c61ab58c8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you create a snapshot, the migration assistant makes a copy of all the resources you select and saves them in the snapshot. The snapshot reflects the current state of the resources when the snapshot is built and is stored locally on your instance, ready to be uploaded in the last stage.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Snapshots created by the migration assistant"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 153,
        "lineEnd": 153,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L153-L153"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Snapshots created by the migration assistant"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ec8e653085a80ff8b087",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Resources saved in the snapshot are strictly limited to the resources stored within an organization. This is important to note if there are multiple organizations used in your Grafana instance. If you want to migrate multiple organizations, refer to [Migrate multiple organizations](#migrate-multiple-organizations) for more information and guidance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Snapshots created by the migration assistant"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 155,
        "lineEnd": 155,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L155-L155"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Snapshots created by the migration assistant"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e96e8cec841508d4ae24",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "During a migration, resource UIDs are preserved, allowing you to correlate your local and cloud resources. If you perform the same migration multiple times, resources in your Grafana Cloud stack that were previously migrated are updated. The assistant never modifies your self-managed resources or cloud resources that didn't come from a snapshot.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Resource migration details"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 159,
        "lineEnd": 159,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L159-L159"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Resource migration details"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.96028827e8758077996f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Dashboard names and UIDs are preserved along with references to data sources. Folder hierarchy is also preserved, so you can find your dashboards and other resources saved in identical folder locations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Resource migration details",
        "Dashboards and folders"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 163,
        "lineEnd": 163,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L163-L163"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Resource migration details > Dashboards and folders"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1eb702658c8e98fe217a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The migration assistant supports any plugins found in the plugins catalog. As long as the plugin is signed or is a core plugin built into Grafana, you can migrate it. Due to security reasons, Grafana Cloud doesn't support unsigned plugins. If you're using any unsigned private plugins, seek an alternative plugin from the catalog or work on a strategy to deprecate certain functionality from your self-managed instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Resource migration details",
        "Plugins"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 171,
        "lineEnd": 171,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L171-L171"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Resource migration details > Plugins"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0b96bb951dfa01f773c4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want to migrate Enterprise plugins, check what type of plan your Grafana Cloud instance is on and whether this plan requires an Enterprise plugin add-on.",
      "headingPath": [
