    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5d3094e6bc65c2c33292",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because the migration assistant doesn't yet migrate teams or RBAC permissions, your resources migrate with default permissions. Reconfigure permissions in your cloud stack as needed after a migration. For more information, refer to [Grafana Cloud user roles and permissions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/account-management/authentication-and-permissions/cloud-roles/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Resource migration details",
        "Resource permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 226,
        "lineEnd": 226,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L226-L226"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Resource migration details > Resource permissions"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.18e34460887c6a4a1474",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're using the [organizations](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/organization-management/#about-organizations) feature on your Grafana Instance and intend to migrate to Grafana Cloud, you need to plan this aspect of the migration carefully.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Migrate multiple organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 230,
        "lineEnd": 230,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L230-L230"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Migrate multiple organizations"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1a2ddf165bfd24b428ad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Cloud doesn't support the organizations feature, but you can use folders and RBAC to protect and grant permissions to resources instead. The recommended path is to migrate multiple organizations to a single cloud stack. This is the simplest option and provides the best user experience.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Migrate multiple organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
