    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.670066a189432de3b649",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The Grafana server administrator has access to the migration assistant by default. The server administrator can perform the migration by switching organizations and running the migration assistant each time. The Grafana server administrator can also grant access to the migration assistant to organization administrators who are members using the RBAC **Migration Assistant:Organization resource migrator** role. This allows those organization administrators to run the migration process for their respective organizations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Migrate multiple organizations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 236,
        "lineEnd": 236,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L236-L236"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Migrate multiple organizations"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e9027a67b44e96771b5e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The main driver for setting up organizations in the first place is resource isolation. In order to achieve this in Grafana Cloud, you can organize resources into folders and set up teams and permissions that correspond to your organizations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Migrate multiple organizations",
        "Access Control and managing resources in the Cloud Instance"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "442319790c30aac80b12ee1e579187566be3e281",
        "sha256": "7e1c09762a6e6cc44729911ca49674305883dafcfb5554aad53f88b1db6722d0",
        "lineStart": 240,
        "lineEnd": 240,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md#L240-L240"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-paid-or-hosted-section-heading",
        "products": [],
        "restriction": "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant > Migrate multiple organizations > Access Control and managing resources in the Cloud Instance"
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cc384ce8540e52c48100",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For more information about configuring teams and permissions, refer to [Configure Grafana Teams](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/team-management/configure-grafana-teams/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant",
        "Migrate multiple organizations",
        "Access Control and managing resources in the Cloud Instance"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant.md",
