    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.995c76587eef4f756a37",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use the [Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/migration-guide/cloud-migration-assistant/), generally available in Grafana v12, to automatically migrate your resources to Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
        "sha256": "c9d95a24ed04bfff932d37d3bc549d6e090c208de06681aefa008a7d06eef4b7",
        "lineStart": 23,
        "lineEnd": 23,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md#L23-L23"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d934c26e29cf5983d773",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need to migrate resources beyond what is supported by the Grafana Cloud Migration Assistant, you can migrate them manually with this guide. Moving your team from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually involves some coordination and communication in addition to the technical migration in the following documentation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Plan and perform a manual migration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
        "sha256": "c9d95a24ed04bfff932d37d3bc549d6e090c208de06681aefa008a7d06eef4b7",
        "lineStart": 28,
        "lineEnd": 28,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md#L28-L28"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1b3f0045ccf3f85a8bec",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you are an existing Grafana OSS/Enterprise customer, contact your account team at Grafana Labs to plan a transition period, arrange licenses, and learn how much your Grafana Cloud subscription costs in comparison to Grafana OSS/Enterprise. The account team can also offer specific guidance and arrange professional services to assist with your migration if needed.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Plan and perform a manual migration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
        "sha256": "c9d95a24ed04bfff932d37d3bc549d6e090c208de06681aefa008a7d06eef4b7",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5990b962928dee794131",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You may choose to test Grafana Cloud for some time before migrating your entire organization. To do so, set up a “test” stack in Cloud and migrate resources there first. If you use Grafana Alerting, make sure to set up a different contact point so that alerts do not fire twice.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Plan and perform a manual migration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
        "sha256": "c9d95a24ed04bfff932d37d3bc549d6e090c208de06681aefa008a7d06eef4b7",
        "lineStart": 34,
        "lineEnd": 34,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md#L34-L34"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d93b950a963fcce6109d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you decide to migrate, set aside a day of cutover during which users should not create new dashboards or alerts. Migrate any newly-created resources, turn on your production Alerting contact points and notification policies in Cloud and turn them off in Grafana OSS/Enterprise, and notify your users. You may also choose to redirect the Grafana OSS/Enterprise URL to your Grafana Cloud URL.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Plan and perform a manual migration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
