    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a0a048a4c5416dec1c92",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you already use tools like [Terraform](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/developer-resources/infrastructure-as-code/terraform/), [Ansible](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/developer-resources/infrastructure-as-code/ansible/), or [Grafana’s HTTP API](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/developer-resources/api-reference/http-api/) to provision resources to Grafana, redirect those to the new Grafana Cloud instance by replacing the Grafana URL and credentials.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Migrate Grafana resources",
        "Migrate resources that are already provisioned as-code"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
