    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5055447d8c2a2cb17729",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "After migrating your data sources, you must fill in their credentials, like tokens, usernames, or passwords. For security reasons, grizzly cannot read encrypted data source credentials from the existing Grafana instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Migrate Grafana resources",
        "Migrate dashboards, folders, data sources, library panels, and alert rules using Grizzly",
        "Fill in data source credentials"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
        "sha256": "c9d95a24ed04bfff932d37d3bc549d6e090c208de06681aefa008a7d06eef4b7",
        "lineStart": 210,
        "lineEnd": 210,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md#L210-L210"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0b4c048fb3fd7ed0d07e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To fill in the missing authentication information, go to the **Connections -> Datasources** page in your new Grafana Cloud instance and verify that credentials for all data sources are set. You can skip data sources starting with `grafanacloud` - These are managed by Grafana Cloud directly and provide access to Grafana Cloud databases.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Migrate Grafana resources",
        "Migrate dashboards, folders, data sources, library panels, and alert rules using Grizzly",
        "Fill in data source credentials"
      ],
      "source": {
