    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f421b7244ab955ec01f1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To access these data sources from Grafana Cloud, follow our guide to [configure PDC in your network](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/connect-externally-hosted/private-data-source-connect/configure-pdc/), and then configure the applicable Grafana data sources to [connect using PDC](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/connect-externally-hosted/private-data-source-connect/configure-pdc/#configure-a-data-source-to-use-private-data-source-connect-pdc). Note that PDC is only needed for your network-secured data sources, not for data sources like Splunk or CloudWatch that are accessible over the public internet.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Migrate Grafana resources",
        "Migrate dashboards, folders, data sources, library panels, and alert rules using Grizzly",
        "Fill in data source credentials",
        "(Optional) Configure Private Data Source Connect (PDC)"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
        "sha256": "c9d95a24ed04bfff932d37d3bc549d6e090c208de06681aefa008a7d06eef4b7",
        "lineStart": 224,
        "lineEnd": 224,
