      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aad58a26ee06caa2b22b",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2. To upload the configuration data you have saved in the `reports.json` file to your new Grafana Cloud instance, run the below command. The command will take the local file `reports.json` and push its contents to the `api/reports` endpoint of your Grafana Cloud instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Migrate Grafana resources",
        "Migrate reports and playlists using Grafana’s HTTP API",
        "Reports (For Grafana Enterprise only)"
      ],
      "source": {
