    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4baadd32588112f59cfe",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "2. To import the playlists, execute the following command. This command constructs an HTTP POST request targeting the `/api/playlists` endpoint of your Grafana Cloud Instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
