    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8942f426a5c24d829df8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Cloud stacks support all of the same authentication and authorization options as Grafana OSS/Enterprise, except for [anonymous authentication](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/anonymous-auth/) and use of the [Auth proxy](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/auth-proxy/). However, single sign-on settings cannot be exported and imported like dashboards, alerts, and other resources.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Migrate Grafana resources",
        "Migrate single sign-on configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
        "sha256": "c9d95a24ed04bfff932d37d3bc549d6e090c208de06681aefa008a7d06eef4b7",
        "lineStart": 280,
        "lineEnd": 280,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md#L280-L280"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d52a8abbe4c7eaf62a6f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To set up SAML authentication from scratch using Grafana’s UI or API, follow [these instructions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-access/configure-authentication/saml/saml-ui/) to Configure SAML authentication in Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Migrate Grafana resources",
        "Migrate single sign-on configuration"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ec67ca7782261b3d96c30c162036cf6fe27e88b5",
        "sha256": "c9d95a24ed04bfff932d37d3bc549d6e090c208de06681aefa008a7d06eef4b7",
        "lineStart": 282,
        "lineEnd": 282,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/migration-guide/manually-migrate-to-grafana-cloud.md#L282-L282"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "unresolved-no-explicit-oss-products-label",
        "products": []
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0022ec9e9deab134f2d2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "LDAP and OIDC/OAuth2 can only be configured in Grafana Cloud by the Grafana Labs support team. Follow [these instructions](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/account-management/authentication-and-permissions/) to request SSO configuration from the support team.",
      "headingPath": [
