    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4ed3536bd5313d027d99",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You may have customized the [configuration](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/setup-grafana/configure-grafana/) of your Grafana OSS/Enterprise instance, for example with feature toggles, custom auth, or embedding options. Since Grafana configuration is stored in environment variables or the filesystem where Grafana runs, Grafana Cloud users do not have access to it. However, you can open a support ticket to ask a Grafana Labs support engineer for customizations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate from Grafana OSS/Enterprise to Grafana Cloud manually",
        "Migrate Grafana resources",
        "Migrate custom Grafana configuration"
      ],
