    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.893e027ae7b72fe9b5ed",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The lowest level always takes precedence. For example, if a user sets their theme to **Light**, then their visualization of Grafana displays the light theme. Nothing at any higher level can override that.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Organization preferences"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/organization-preferences/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0df51d324c7d3d568d23940c13bc3dbbd17fc837",
        "sha256": "24bd30657bd4be443ef57a5b6383dcdba88940fbe38dce304fa4c6bd4586cc25",
        "lineStart": 28,
        "lineEnd": 28,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/organization-preferences/index.md#L28-L28"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c87b39c74fa1cccc451a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the user is aware of the change and intended it, then that's great! But if the user is a Server Admin who made the change to their user preferences a long time ago, they might have forgotten they did that. Then, if that Server Admin is trying to change the theme at the server level, they'll get frustrated as none of their changes have any effect that they can see. (Also, the users on the server might be confused, because _they_ can see the server-level changes!)",
      "headingPath": [
        "Organization preferences"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/organization-preferences/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "0df51d324c7d3d568d23940c13bc3dbbd17fc837",
        "sha256": "24bd30657bd4be443ef57a5b6383dcdba88940fbe38dce304fa4c6bd4586cc25",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/organization-preferences/index.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
