      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "As a Grafana server administrator, you can change the default Grafana UI theme for all users who are on the server by setting the [default_theme](../../setup-grafana/configure-grafana/#default_theme) option in the Grafana configuration file.",
