      "id": "grafana.candidate.81d0a11299ba3e8ba541",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The home dashboard you set is the one all users will see by default when they log in. Click the Grafana icon or **Home** in the breadcrumb to return to it. You can set the home dashboard for the server, an organization, a team, or your personal user account. This topic provides instructions for each task.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Organization preferences",
        "Change the default home dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/organization-preferences/index.md",
