      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana Cloud, most plugins are automatically kept up to date. When a new version is available it’s updated on your behalf, and you don’t need to take any action. For more information and exceptions, refer to [Updates to Grafana-managed plugins](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/introduction/find-and-use-plugins/#updates-to-grafana-managed-plugins) in the Grafana Cloud documentation.",
