      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can configure your Grafana instance to let the frontends of installed plugins directly communicate locally with the backends of other installed plugins. See how in [Configure backend communication between installed plugins](plugin-integrate).",
