      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "We strongly recommend enabling the Frontend Sandbox for plugins that allow users to write custom JavaScript code for data visualization or manipulation, since they can potentially execute arbitrary JavaScript code in your Grafana instance. The sandbox provides an additional layer of security by restricting what this code can access and modify.",
