      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For advanced as code options such as Infrastructure as code, Git Sync or on-prem file provisioning refer to [Deploy, configure and provision Grafana with as-code workflows](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/as-code/).",
