      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7cc704477157c6643c6d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **10 seconds or less**: Grafana watches the filesystem for changes and updates dashboards when it detects them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Provision Grafana",
        "Dashboards",
        "Example dashboard configuration file",
        "Detect updates to provisioned dashboards files"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/provisioning/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a6caad47dea63fb1a213a61490f8f587ad16bba2",
        "sha256": "ae39c9c2a4c0e896492c8df476ac2f5ddb821206f6828b18e8d6bb1c2489bf61",
        "lineStart": 435,
        "lineEnd": 435,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/provisioning/index.md#L435-L435"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a281c0dbe25c65aababa",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When `updateIntervalSeconds` is 10 or less, Grafana relies on filesystem watch events to detect changes. Depending on your filesystem and how you mount or sync dashboard files (for example, Docker bind mounts or some network filesystems), those events might not reach Grafana. To work around this, set `updateIntervalSeconds` to more than 10 to force polling, or update your setup so filesystem watch events are propagated.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Provision Grafana",
        "Dashboards",
        "Example dashboard configuration file",
        "Detect updates to provisioned dashboards files"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/provisioning/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a6caad47dea63fb1a213a61490f8f587ad16bba2",
        "sha256": "ae39c9c2a4c0e896492c8df476ac2f5ddb821206f6828b18e8d6bb1c2489bf61",
        "lineStart": 438,
        "lineEnd": 440,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/provisioning/index.md#L438-L440"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9937bcb1ecc4efc1bd15",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can make changes to a provisioned dashboard in the Grafana UI but its not possible to automatically save the changes back to the provisioning source. If `allowUiUpdates` is set to `true` and you make changes to a provisioned dashboard, when you save the dashboard, Grafana persists the changes to its database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Provision Grafana",
        "Dashboards",
        "Example dashboard configuration file",
        "Make changes to a provisioned dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/provisioning/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a6caad47dea63fb1a213a61490f8f587ad16bba2",
        "sha256": "ae39c9c2a4c0e896492c8df476ac2f5ddb821206f6828b18e8d6bb1c2489bf61",
        "lineStart": 445,
        "lineEnd": 446,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/provisioning/index.md#L445-L446"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dd85f822f9e804f58c21",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you save a provisioned dashboard in the UI and then later update the provisioning source, Grafana always overwrites the database dashboard with the one from the provisioning file. Grafana ignores the `version` property in the JSON file, even if it's lower than the dashboard in the database.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Provision Grafana",
        "Dashboards",
        "Example dashboard configuration file",
        "Make changes to a provisioned dashboard"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/provisioning/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "a6caad47dea63fb1a213a61490f8f587ad16bba2",
        "sha256": "ae39c9c2a4c0e896492c8df476ac2f5ddb821206f6828b18e8d6bb1c2489bf61",
        "lineStart": 449,
        "lineEnd": 450,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/provisioning/index.md#L449-L450"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
