      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Recorded queries only work with backend data source plugins. Refer to [Backend data source plugin](/tutorials/build-a-data-source-backend-plugin/) for more information about backend data source plugins. You can recorded four types of queries:",
