    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.23af50393ca2881cc13a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you want to extend a viewer's ability to edit and save dashboard changes or limit an editor's permission to modify a dashboard, you can assign permissions to dashboards and folders. For example, you might want a certain viewer to be able to edit a dashboard. While that user can _see_ all dashboards, you can grant them access to _update_ only one of them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Roles and permissions",
        "Dashboard permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/_index.md",
