      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Edit**: Can create, edit, or delete a dashboard. Can edit or delete a folder, and create dashboards and subfolders in a folder. Editors _cannot_ change folder or dashboard permissions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Roles and permissions",
        "Dashboard permissions"
