    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.06af16dea578d4bc37ad",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can use RBAC to modify the permissions associated with any basic role, which changes what viewers, editors, or admins can do. If you modify a basic role, [the change is not propagated to the other basic roles](#permission-propagation). You can't delete basic roles.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Role-based access control (RBAC) overview",
        "Available RBAC roles",
        "Basic roles",
        "Modify basic roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "74dd3ddc8f134bbb82118411a9c878c6245618fa",
