    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b23d86873db7f097aab9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're using Grafana Enterprise or Grafana Cloud, you can assign discrete fixed roles to users, teams, and service accounts. This gives you fine-grained control over user permissions than you would have with basic roles alone. These roles are called \"fixed\" because you cannot change or delete fixed roles. You can also create _custom_ roles of your own; see more information in the [custom roles section](#custom-roles) below.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Role-based access control (RBAC) overview",
        "Available RBAC roles",
        "Fixed roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "74dd3ddc8f134bbb82118411a9c878c6245618fa",
        "sha256": "85a1d0f117bae2ef3e87f0861a8a0b5da4e80c5282d771b959d5c8a2a1d0bdd1",
        "lineStart": 178,
        "lineEnd": 178,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md#L178-L178"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4e1fed5d7b982dc898c8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Assign fixed roles when the basic roles do not meet your permission requirements. For example, you might want a user with the basic viewer role to also edit dashboards. Or, you might want anyone with the editor role to also add and manage users. Fixed roles provide users more granular access to create, view, and update the following Grafana resources:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Role-based access control (RBAC) overview",
        "Available RBAC roles",
        "Fixed roles"
      ],
      "source": {
