    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0152a5febaa47bc8229e",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The `teams:id:1` scope restricts the user's action to the team with ID `1`. When paired with the `teams.roles:read` action, this permission prohibits the user from viewing the roles for teams other than team `1`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Role-based access control (RBAC) overview",
        "Available RBAC roles",
        "Custom roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "74dd3ddc8f134bbb82118411a9c878c6245618fa",
        "sha256": "85a1d0f117bae2ef3e87f0861a8a0b5da4e80c5282d771b959d5c8a2a1d0bdd1",
        "lineStart": 211,
        "lineEnd": 211,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md#L211-L211"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ef49ca54bf3d1379f4b2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Consider creating a custom role only when fixed roles do not meet your permissions requirements. To learn more, refer to [Create custom roles](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Role-based access control (RBAC) overview",
        "Available RBAC roles",
        "Custom roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "74dd3ddc8f134bbb82118411a9c878c6245618fa",
        "sha256": "85a1d0f117bae2ef3e87f0861a8a0b5da4e80c5282d771b959d5c8a2a1d0bdd1",
        "lineStart": 213,
        "lineEnd": 213,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md#L213-L213"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ddac362c5cc6cd7275a1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you modify a specific basic role, the change is not propagated to the other basic roles. In other words, if you modify Viewer basic role and grant it additional permissions, Editors or Admins won't be updated with that additional grant.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Role-based access control (RBAC) overview",
        "Permission propagation"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "74dd3ddc8f134bbb82118411a9c878c6245618fa",
        "sha256": "85a1d0f117bae2ef3e87f0861a8a0b5da4e80c5282d771b959d5c8a2a1d0bdd1",
        "lineStart": 217,
        "lineEnd": 217,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md#L217-L217"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.751d7e988269118578f4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When a new permission is created, it's added automatically to modified basic roles. This means that a feature you thought you removed can get new permissions added back.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Role-based access control (RBAC) overview",
        "New permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "74dd3ddc8f134bbb82118411a9c878c6245618fa",
        "sha256": "85a1d0f117bae2ef3e87f0861a8a0b5da4e80c5282d771b959d5c8a2a1d0bdd1",
        "lineStart": 221,
        "lineEnd": 221,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md#L221-L221"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c85eb15d96e16cf0520f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you're using custom roles, new permissions are not added automatically. If a new feature that requires additional permissions is released, you will have to add the permissions to custom roles manually.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Role-based access control (RBAC) overview",
        "New permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "74dd3ddc8f134bbb82118411a9c878c6245618fa",
