      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Assign a fixed role to a user as a server administrator. This approach enables you to assign a fixed role to a user in multiple organizations, without needing to switch organizations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Assign RBAC roles",
