      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In both cases, the assignment applies only to the user, team or service account within the affected organization, and no other organizations. For example, if you grant the user the **Data source editor** role in the **Main** organization, then the user can edit data sources in the **Main** organization, but not in other organizations.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Assign RBAC roles",
