      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Instead of using the Grafana role picker, you can use file-based provisioning to assign fixed roles to teams. If you have a large number of teams, provisioning can provide an easier approach to assigning and managing role assignments.",
