    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a659cc206259a0d6ea06",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following examples show you how to create a custom role using the Grafana HTTP API. For more information about the HTTP API, refer to [Create a new custom role](ref:api-rbac-create-a-new-custom-role).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create custom RBAC roles",
        "Create custom roles using the HTTP API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c1e14a922787a6e57b9e58fbf1faa34693c53abe",
        "sha256": "697aeb40a2c923f1f32f32716f90540b5e0d2a873a91a8e152e35910b1b8c426",
        "lineStart": 110,
        "lineEnd": 110,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles/index.md#L110-L110"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.92923115e68e95fdb725",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you create a custom role you can only give it the same permissions you already have. For example, if you only have `users:create` permissions, then you can't create a role that includes other permissions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create custom RBAC roles",
        "Create custom roles using the HTTP API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c1e14a922787a6e57b9e58fbf1faa34693c53abe",
        "sha256": "697aeb40a2c923f1f32f32716f90540b5e0d2a873a91a8e152e35910b1b8c426",
        "lineStart": 113,
        "lineEnd": 113,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles/index.md#L113-L113"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.995ffa50034882687c09",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following example creates a `custom:users:admin` role and assigns the `users:create` action to it.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create custom RBAC roles",
        "Create custom roles using the HTTP API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "c1e14a922787a6e57b9e58fbf1faa34693c53abe",
        "sha256": "697aeb40a2c923f1f32f32716f90540b5e0d2a873a91a8e152e35910b1b8c426",
        "lineStart": 116,
        "lineEnd": 116,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles/index.md#L116-L116"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7a4e0f9abc6e5881f0d0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Refer to the [RBAC HTTP API](ref:api-rbac-create-a-new-custom-role) for more details.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create custom RBAC roles",
        "Create custom roles using the HTTP API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles/index.md",
