      "sourceText": "If you're using Grafana Enterprise or Grafana Cloud, you can create **custom roles** with specific sets of permissions. Refer to [Create custom roles](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/create-custom-roles) to learn how.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana RBAC permission actions and scopes"
      ],
