      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`annotations:*`</li><li>`annotations:type:*`</li></ul>       | Restrict an action to a set of annotations. For example, `annotations:*` matches any annotation, and `annotations:type:organization` matches organization annotations. |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana RBAC permission actions and scopes",
        "Scope definitions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/custom-role-actions-scopes/index.md",
