      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`dashboards:*`</li><li>`dashboards:uid:*`</li></ul>          | Restrict an action to a set of dashboards. For example, `dashboards:*` matches any dashboard, and `dashboards:uid:1` matches the dashboard whose UID is `1`.                                                                                       |",
      "headingPath": [
