      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`datasources:*`</li><li>`datasources:uid:*`</li></ul>        | Restrict an action to a set of data sources. For example, `datasources:*` matches any data source, and `datasources:uid:1` matches the data source whose UID is `1`.                                                                               |",
