      "id": "grafana.candidate.ef71a589322919d172af",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`folders:*`</li><li>`folders:uid:*`</li></ul>                | Restrict an action to a set of folders. For example, `folders:*` matches any folder, and `folders:uid:1` matches the folder whose UID is `1`. Note that permissions granted to a folder cascade down to subfolders located under it.               |",
