      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`plugins:*`</li><li>`plugins:id:*`</li></ul>                 | Restrict an action to a set of plugins. For example, `plugins:id:grafana-oncall-app` matches Grafana OnCall plugin, and `plugins:*` matches all plugins.                                                                                           |",
