      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`provisioners:*`</li><ul>                                    | Restrict an action to a set of provisioners. For example, `provisioners:*` matches any provisioner, and `provisioners:accesscontrol` matches the role-based access control [provisioner](ref:rbac-grafana-provisioning).           |",
