      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`roles:*`</li><li>`roles:uid:*`</li></ul>                    | Restrict an action to a set of roles. For example, `roles:*` matches any role and `roles:uid:randomuid` matches only the role whose UID is `randomuid`.                                                                                            |",
