      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`serviceaccounts:*`</li><li>`serviceaccounts:id:*`</li></ul> | Restrict an action to a set of service account from an organization. For example, `serviceaccounts:*` matches any service account and `serviceaccount:id:1` matches the service account whose ID is `1`.                                           |",
