      "sourceText": "| <ul><li>`teams:*`</li><li>`teams:id:*`</li></ul>                     | Restrict an action to a set of teams from an organization. For example, `teams:*` matches any team and `teams:id:1` matches the team whose ID is `1`.                                                                                              |",
