    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b60feefd34969ad602c1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The action definitions table above lists actions for core Grafana features. App plugins can define their own actions, which follow the pattern `<plugin-id>.<resource>:<operation>`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana RBAC permission actions and scopes",
        "Discover plugin actions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/custom-role-actions-scopes/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "93c7c93cdbcace41e0dc1fec9da4a41df1b8adcf",
        "sha256": "2069857b3ded59f34b9f1fc43086400604418e2d2ca2ea169a4cc859ad971a29",
        "lineStart": 248,
        "lineEnd": 248,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/custom-role-actions-scopes/index.md#L248-L248"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4944e08334d86be1c6e9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To discover which actions a plugin supports, query an existing role that has plugin permissions. For example, to see what actions are available for a plugin, you can query the basic Admin role:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Grafana RBAC permission actions and scopes",
        "Discover plugin actions"
      ],
      "source": {
