    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.616af28e9a1e76c03b53",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This works when logged in as an Admin user.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "View basic role definitions",
        "Using the browser"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 130,
        "lineEnd": 130,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L130-L130"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a2fea0c770f3b3cc4694",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the default basic role permissions don't meet your requirements you can change them.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 138,
        "lineEnd": 138,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L138-L138"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.39cef2138476240391d7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Basic roles are mutable. You can add or remove individual permissions on the `Viewer`, `Editor`, `Admin`, and `Grafana Admin` roles without creating a custom role. Each permission is a combination of an `action` and a `scope`. For example, you can remove access to a specific app plugin from all viewers by removing the relevant permissions from the `basic:viewer` role.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 140,
        "lineEnd": 140,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L140-L140"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1daacb97fabe2506f35f",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Changes that you make to a basic role apply to every [organization](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/organization-management/) in the Grafana instance. For example, if you add the `fixed:users:writer` role's permissions to the `Viewer` basic role, all viewers in every organization in the instance can create users.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 145,
        "lineEnd": 145,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L145-L145"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.be05505e470912b5c24d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Basic role changes are scoped to a single Grafana instance. On Grafana Cloud, each stack is a separate instance, so you must apply the change to each stack individually.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 147,
        "lineEnd": 147,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L147-L147"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.17ebc97be8aa4f068331",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you only need to change access for specific users or teams rather than for every viewer, editor, or admin, leave the basic roles unchanged. Instead, assign the `No Basic Role` organization role and grant fixed or custom roles to those users or teams. For more information, refer to [Assign RBAC roles](ref:assign-rbac-roles).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 151,
        "lineEnd": 151,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L151-L151"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.b430a60a7a9f82c72091",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can change basic roles' permissions [via the configuration file](#update-basic-role-permissions-in-the-configuration-file) or [using the RBAC API](#update-basic-role-permissions-using-the-rbac-api).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 154,
        "lineEnd": 154,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L154-L154"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a9419599301b5d3a7d92",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Before you begin, determine the permissions you want to add or remove from a basic role. For more information about the permissions associated with basic roles, refer to [RBAC role definitions](ref:rbac-fixed-basic-role-definitions-basic-role-assignments).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions",
        "Update basic role permissions in the configuration file"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
