    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e80fb8eb45370edb7b2c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use the RBAC HTTP API when you want to change basic role permissions programmatically, for example from a script or a CI pipeline. The API uses two endpoints:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions",
        "Update basic role permissions using the RBAC API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 226,
        "lineEnd": 226,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L226-L226"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4001bec8e84f80e4f0bf",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `GET /api/access-control/roles/{roleUID}` returns a basic role and all of its permissions. Refer to [Get a role](ref:api-rbac-get-a-role).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions",
        "Update basic role permissions using the RBAC API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 228,
        "lineEnd": 228,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L228-L228"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e410dbd78fb27855a84f",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- `PUT /api/access-control/roles/{roleUID}` replaces the role's permissions with the set that you send. Refer to [Update a role](ref:api-rbac-update-a-role).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions",
        "Update basic role permissions using the RBAC API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 229,
        "lineEnd": 229,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L229-L229"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2dadb29a6bd57361526c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because `PUT` replaces the entire permission set, fetch the current role first, modify its permissions, increment its `version`, and then send the result back. Each request authenticates with a [service account token](ref:service-accounts) that has the `Role writer` role, or with basic authentication as a `Grafana Admin`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions",
        "Update basic role permissions using the RBAC API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 233,
        "lineEnd": 233,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L233-L233"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0f11460203a2089e8b54",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Send `global: true` in the request body when you update a global basic role, and set `version` to a value higher than the current version. Grafana rejects updates that don't increase the version.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions",
        "Update basic role permissions using the RBAC API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 236,
        "lineEnd": 236,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md#L236-L236"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.06b4e9fa3bb60bba122c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following example makes the same change as the [configuration file example](#example-modify-the-grafana-admin-role) using the API instead. It removes the permissions to list, grant, and revoke roles to teams, and adds permissions to read and write Grafana folders.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Update role permissions",
        "Update basic role permissions using the RBAC API",
        "Example: Modify the Grafana Admin role using the API"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/manage-rbac-roles/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ea0a862bb162a4d71c0f3227505ebaba435602be",
        "sha256": "7364c2ee9547673e276389fe52d419ad199aa6a25122aa7277b7a31a869ca038",
        "lineStart": 241,
