    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.57da882c2d4390a8f618",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `jq` filters first strip the read-only `created` and `updated` timestamps and increment the role `version`, then remove the unwanted permissions, and finally append the new ones. The `PUT` request sends the resulting role definition back to Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
