      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, viewers can access all app plugins that their organization role allows, including Grafana Assistant. To prevent viewers from accessing Grafana Assistant, remove the following permissions from the `basic:viewer` role:",
