    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.414660c96373b7d7655e",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Grant the `action: \"roles:write\", scope: \"permissions:type:escalate` permission to `Grafana Admin`. Note that this permission has not been granted to any basic roles by default, because users could acquire more permissions than they previously had through the basic role permissions reset.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage RBAC roles",
        "Reset basic roles to their default",
        "Use the HTTP endpoint"
      ],
