    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2475388425490b687846",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. As a `Grafana Admin`, call the API endpoint to reset the basic roles to their default. Refer to the [RBAC HTTP API](ref:api-rbac-reset-basic-roles-to-their-default) for more details.",
      "headingPath": [
