    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5b0e6c2a93eaa07cce9e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "RBAC is a flexible and powerful feature with many possible permissions assignment combinations available. Consider the follow guidelines when assigning permissions to users and teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your RBAC rollout strategy",
        "User and team considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bfb1abe7463e753a27609a4020b4982dca3c3166",
        "sha256": "ff1b64f680c6f29b73014551d40e3c834698e27630901a79b72290900d74f2a6",
        "lineStart": 69,
        "lineEnd": 69,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md#L69-L69"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d73fd4d535fb411b1662",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Assign roles to users** when you have a one-off scenario where a small number of users require access to a resource or when you want to assign temporary access. If you have a large number of users, this approach can be difficult to manage as you scale your use of Grafana. For example, a member of your IT department might need the `fixed:licensing:reader` and `fixed:licensing:writer` roles so that they can manage your Grafana Enterprise license.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your RBAC rollout strategy",
        "User and team considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bfb1abe7463e753a27609a4020b4982dca3c3166",
        "sha256": "ff1b64f680c6f29b73014551d40e3c834698e27630901a79b72290900d74f2a6",
        "lineStart": 71,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md#L71-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8624e7d9fd24df10124c",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Assign roles to teams** when you have a subset of users that align to your organizational structure, and you want all members of the team to have the same level of access. For example, all members of a particular engineering team might need the `fixed:reports:reader` and `fixed:reports:writer` roles to be able to manage reports.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your RBAC rollout strategy",
        "User and team considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bfb1abe7463e753a27609a4020b4982dca3c3166",
        "sha256": "ff1b64f680c6f29b73014551d40e3c834698e27630901a79b72290900d74f2a6",
        "lineStart": 73,
        "lineEnd": 73,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md#L73-L73"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0ded567909359dc0daa5",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When you assign additional users to a team, the system automatically assigns permissions to those users.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your RBAC rollout strategy",
        "User and team considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bfb1abe7463e753a27609a4020b4982dca3c3166",
        "sha256": "ff1b64f680c6f29b73014551d40e3c834698e27630901a79b72290900d74f2a6",
        "lineStart": 75,
        "lineEnd": 75,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md#L75-L75"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.01e2024505650f0e282d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can take advantage of your current authentication provider to manage user and team permissions in Grafana. When you map users and teams to SAML and LDAP groups, you can synchronize those assignments with Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your RBAC rollout strategy",
        "User and team considerations",
        "Authentication provider considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bfb1abe7463e753a27609a4020b4982dca3c3166",
        "sha256": "ff1b64f680c6f29b73014551d40e3c834698e27630901a79b72290900d74f2a6",
        "lineStart": 79,
        "lineEnd": 79,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md#L79-L79"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.db64645e147e84921613",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. Map SAML, LDAP, or Oauth roles to Grafana basic roles (viewer, editor, or admin).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your RBAC rollout strategy",
        "User and team considerations",
        "Authentication provider considerations"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bfb1abe7463e753a27609a4020b4982dca3c3166",
        "sha256": "ff1b64f680c6f29b73014551d40e3c834698e27630901a79b72290900d74f2a6",
        "lineStart": 83,
        "lineEnd": 83,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md#L83-L83"
