    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9a2efe0957122da334f4",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Modify basic roles** when Grafana's definitions of what viewers, editors, and admins can do does not match your definition of these roles. You can add or remove permissions from any basic role.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your RBAC rollout strategy",
        "When to modify basic roles or create custom roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "bfb1abe7463e753a27609a4020b4982dca3c3166",
