    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d005ecb8cc742e8a11ac",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Create custom roles** when fixed role definitions don't meet you permissions requirements. For example, the `fixed:dashboards:writer` role allows users to delete dashboards. If you want some users or teams to be able to create and update but not delete dashboards, you can create a custom role with a name like `custom:dashboards:creator` that lacks the `dashboards:delete` permission.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Plan your RBAC rollout strategy",
        "When to modify basic roles or create custom roles"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/plan-rbac-rollout-strategy/index.md",
