      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you want your `Viewers` to create reports, [update the `Viewer` basic role permissions](ref:manage-rbac-roles-update-basic-role-permissions). There are two ways to achieve this:",
