    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c3ff3bfb3994b96c1927",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Viewers, Editors and Admins have access to all App Plugins that their organization role allows them to access. To change this default behavior and prevent Viewers from accessing an App plugin, you must [update a basic role's permissions](ref:manage-rbac-roles-update-basic-role-permissions).",
