    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.855635b26cbf8f66dbbd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using Service Accounts is an efficient way to facilitate M2M communications. However, they can pose a security threat if not scoped appropriately. To limit the scope of a service account, you can begin by creating a Service Account with `None` basic role and then assign the necessary permissions for the account.",
