      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "There is only one exclusion. Role `fixed:alerting.provisioning:writer` does not require user to have any additional permissions and provides access to all aspects of the alerting configuration via special provisioning API.",
