    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.348d26949059362447bb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To list all the permissions granted to a basic role, use the [HTTP API endpoint to query for the role](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/developers/http_api/access_control/#get-a-role). Basic role UIDs are listed in [RBAC role definitions list](ref:rbac-role-definitions).",
      "headingPath": [
        "RBAC for app plugins",
        "Fine-grained access to app plugins",
        "Revoke fine-grained access from app plugins"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-for-app-plugins/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e4186760f49dbcfa912c522d97c34671a2ac1093",
        "sha256": "616dd8e22f0a5ec06391c91af75f471c1d2f3c352b2c88e42c9505689b0ec89f",
        "lineStart": 95,
        "lineEnd": 95,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-for-app-plugins/index.md#L95-L95"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0cdd9b4263be825c4102",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To remove any undesired plugin permissions from a basic role, [update the basic role's permissions](ref:manage-rbac-roles-update-basic-role-permissions).",
      "headingPath": [
        "RBAC for app plugins",
        "Fine-grained access to app plugins",
        "Revoke fine-grained access from app plugins"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-for-app-plugins/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e4186760f49dbcfa912c522d97c34671a2ac1093",
        "sha256": "616dd8e22f0a5ec06391c91af75f471c1d2f3c352b2c88e42c9505689b0ec89f",
        "lineStart": 97,
        "lineEnd": 97,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-for-app-plugins/index.md#L97-L97"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c3e98d861b5edc7c9d21",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To grant access to app plugins, you can use the predefined [fixed plugin roles](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/#fixed-roles) or create [custom roles](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/#custom-roles) with specific plugin permissions. To learn about how to assign an RBAC role, refer to [the documentation on assigning RBAC roles](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/assign-rbac-roles/#assign-rbac-roles).",
      "headingPath": [
        "RBAC for app plugins",
        "Grant additional access to app plugins"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-for-app-plugins/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "e4186760f49dbcfa912c522d97c34671a2ac1093",
        "sha256": "616dd8e22f0a5ec06391c91af75f471c1d2f3c352b2c88e42c9505689b0ec89f",
        "lineStart": 101,
        "lineEnd": 102,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-for-app-plugins/index.md#L101-L102"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a1bcf46ca453ae93bb5a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "You can create, change or remove [Custom roles](ref:manage-rbac-roles-create-custom-roles-using-provisioning) and create or remove [basic role assignments](ref:assign-rbac-roles-assign-a-fixed-role-to-a-basic-role-using-provisioning), by adding one or more YAML configuration files in the `provisioning/access-control/` directory.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Provisioning RBAC with Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-grafana-provisioning/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "22c6c01fa0d84d44b3ac1337885bd6498d55db31",
        "sha256": "b28fb3035cfecf9feabc6988bddcacf2d2a6dedec982c23ab8e8deaeafd42aae",
        "lineStart": 57,
        "lineEnd": 57,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-grafana-provisioning/index.md#L57-L57"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ac8946c08d2f40a6994a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Because this method requires access to the file system where Grafana is running, it's only available for self-managed Grafana instances. To provision RBAC in Grafana Cloud, use [Terraform](ref:rbac-terraform-provisioning) or the [HTTP API](ref:api-rbac-create-and-manage-custom-roles).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Provisioning RBAC with Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-grafana-provisioning/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "22c6c01fa0d84d44b3ac1337885bd6498d55db31",
        "sha256": "b28fb3035cfecf9feabc6988bddcacf2d2a6dedec982c23ab8e8deaeafd42aae",
        "lineStart": 59,
        "lineEnd": 59,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-grafana-provisioning/index.md#L59-L59"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a2bc4f8c1ea113e7fe87",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana performs provisioning during startup. After you make a change to the configuration file, you can reload it during runtime. You do not need to restart the Grafana server for your changes to take effect.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Provisioning RBAC with Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-grafana-provisioning/index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "22c6c01fa0d84d44b3ac1337885bd6498d55db31",
        "sha256": "b28fb3035cfecf9feabc6988bddcacf2d2a6dedec982c23ab8e8deaeafd42aae",
        "lineStart": 61,
        "lineEnd": 61,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/roles-and-permissions/access-control/rbac-grafana-provisioning/index.md#L61-L61"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "excluded-by-explicit-document-products",
        "products": [
          "enterprise"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5b3fd0bbd9fcebd3346e",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- Ensure that you have access to files on the server where Grafana is running.",
      "headingPath": [
