      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Set the `role` attribute on the [`grafana_service_account`](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/service_account) resource:",
      "headingPath": [
