    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5708ab9ad27e40b37aef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Note that instead of using a provisioned role, you can also look up the `uid` of an already existing fixed or custom role and use that instead. You can use the [API endpoint for listing roles](ref:api-rbac-create-and-manage-custom-roles) to look up role `uid`s. Similarly, you can look up and use `id`s of users, teams and service accounts that have not been provisioned to assign roles to them.",
