    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1a55cf56971ebc44f446",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- You can grant granular permissions to service accounts by leveraging [role-based access control](ref:rbac). For more information about permissions, refer to [About users and permissions](ref:roles-and-permissions).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Service accounts",
        "When to use service accounts",
        "Service account benefits"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/service-accounts/_index.md",
