    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6915b4232e573a46c53c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A service account token is a generated random string that acts as an alternative to a password when authenticating with the Grafana HTTP API. Use service access tokens the same way as API Keys, for example to access Grafana HTTP API programmatically. Service account access tokens inherit permissions from the service account.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Service accounts",
        "Service account tokens"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/service-accounts/_index.md",
