      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In [Grafana Enterprise](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/introduction/grafana-enterprise/), you can also [assign RBAC roles](ref:rbac-assign-rbac-roles) to grant very specific permissions to applications that interact with Grafana.",
