      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This section shows you how to migrate API keys to Grafana service accounts using the Grafana user interface. You can choose to migrate a single API key or all API keys. When you migrate all API keys, you can no longer create API keys and must use service accounts instead.",
