      "sourceText": "For migration your cloud stack api keys, use the `grafana_cloud_stack_service_account` and `gafana_cloud_stack_service_account_token` resources. For additional information, refer to [Grafana Cloud Stack Service Accounts in Terraform](https://registry.terraform.io/providers/grafana/grafana/latest/docs/resources/cloud_stack_service_account).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Migrate API keys to service account tokens",
        "Migrate Cloud Stack API keys using Terraform"
      ],
