    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2c96dfe22c02f98c2737",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana Teams makes it easy to organize and administer groups of users in your enterprise. Teams allows you to grant permissions to a group of users instead of granting permissions to individual users one at a time.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage teams with Grafana Teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/team-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "5fff00428f3d796628838806cc49fd3f71d9d87e",
        "sha256": "36a70af8d3a3e81f77690a0c6e06032b89346afe2170b10bca8db98649bb812e",
        "lineStart": 24,
        "lineEnd": 24,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/team-management/_index.md#L24-L24"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.df8b61a03ed084695a33",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Teams are useful in a wide variety of scenarios, such as when onboarding new colleagues or needing access to reports on secure financial data. When you add a user to a team, they get access to all resources assigned to that team.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage teams with Grafana Teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/team-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "5fff00428f3d796628838806cc49fd3f71d9d87e",
        "sha256": "36a70af8d3a3e81f77690a0c6e06032b89346afe2170b10bca8db98649bb812e",
        "lineStart": 26,
        "lineEnd": 26,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/team-management/_index.md#L26-L26"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6972648fab899aebc1b0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A Grafana Team is a group of users within an organization that have common permissions, including access to dashboards and data sources, and those permissions apply to **all members** of that team. For example, instead of assigning six users access to the same dashboard, you can create a team that consists of those users and assign dashboard permissions to the team. A user can belong to multiple teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Manage teams with Grafana Teams",
        "Teams concepts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/team-management/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "5fff00428f3d796628838806cc49fd3f71d9d87e",
        "sha256": "36a70af8d3a3e81f77690a0c6e06032b89346afe2170b10bca8db98649bb812e",
