    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.50f5be01d78ce12330e0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The role you use to sign in to Grafana determines how you see Teams lists.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Administer Grafana Teams",
        "View a list of Teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/team-management/administering-grafana-teams.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "2d25053437ea5847713046825d3e0e7e09716d5d",
        "sha256": "c89666d7f3a2a01685cd7a4080b2ca13766d61372e7d74978a8fdac0293c94f3",
        "lineStart": 30,
        "lineEnd": 30,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/team-management/administering-grafana-teams.md#L30-L30"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8a83e8253352d0a76081",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana recommends you use Teams to organize and manage access to Grafana’s core resources, such as dashboards and alerts. Teams is an easy organizational tool to manage, and allows flexible sharing between teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Administer Grafana Teams",
        "Teams best practices"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/team-management/administering-grafana-teams.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "2d25053437ea5847713046825d3e0e7e09716d5d",
        "sha256": "c89666d7f3a2a01685cd7a4080b2ca13766d61372e7d74978a8fdac0293c94f3",
        "lineStart": 46,
        "lineEnd": 46,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/team-management/administering-grafana-teams.md#L46-L46"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1f9151fd60f9683653cb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana recommends that you use Instances or Stacks to separate Teams if you want true isolation, to ensure that no information leaks between Teams. You can synchronize some resources between instances using provisioning.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Administer Grafana Teams",
        "Teams best practices"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/team-management/administering-grafana-teams.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "2d25053437ea5847713046825d3e0e7e09716d5d",
        "sha256": "c89666d7f3a2a01685cd7a4080b2ca13766d61372e7d74978a8fdac0293c94f3",
        "lineStart": 48,
        "lineEnd": 48,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/administration/team-management/administering-grafana-teams.md#L48-L48"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "enterprise",
          "oss",
          "cloud"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f931aa6abb019fe5f49c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The most important thing to consider for securing Teams is to only grant team administrator rights to the users you trust to administer the Team.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Administer Grafana Teams",
        "Secure Grafana Teams"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/team-management/administering-grafana-teams.md",
