      "id": "grafana.candidate.58c025ed3bd1a2eb6800",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The **New team** page also includes a **Auto-create a team folder** option. Select **Auto-create a team folder** if you want Grafana to create a folder owned by that team during setup. For more information, refer to [Manage team folders](/docs/grafana/<GRAFANA_VERSION>/administration/team-management/team-folders/).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Grafana Teams",
        "Create a Grafana Team"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/team-management/configure-grafana-teams.md",
