    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.342133a79ba6655876b9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following topics describe how to use permissions to control user access to data sources, dashboards, users, and teams.",
      "headingPath": [
        "User management"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/user-management/_index.md",
