    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f9c30dca14a27590f303",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, if a user with the viewer organization role requires editor (or admin) access to a dashboard, you can assign those elevated permissions on an individual basis.",
