      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Update user permissions when you want to enhance or restrict a user's access to organization resources. For more information about organization permissions, refer to [Organization roles](../../roles-and-permissions/#organization-roles).",
