    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e056fb9d380dd5083274",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you suspect a user account is compromised or is no longer authorized to access the Grafana server, then you can force the user to log out of Grafana.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Server user management",
        "Force a user to log out of Grafana"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/administration/user-management/server-user-management/_index.md",
