    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.39cea66b466cb62d2c1a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Monitor your incoming metrics data or log entries and set up your Grafana Alerting system to watch for specific events or circumstances.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "5d406b86ad9e6e246387efcf33b4df206e2770a4",
        "sha256": "ef0d821f9dfe32acdabb4a24b2a5231deddc6fa20bedf8e1882231f7d19612e4",
        "lineStart": 58,
        "lineEnd": 58,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/_index.md#L58-L58"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.8d35279c7b91dfb1c7ff",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In this way, you eliminate the need for manual monitoring and provide a first line of defense against system outages or changes that could turn into major incidents.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "5d406b86ad9e6e246387efcf33b4df206e2770a4",
        "sha256": "ef0d821f9dfe32acdabb4a24b2a5231deddc6fa20bedf8e1882231f7d19612e4",
        "lineStart": 60,
        "lineEnd": 60,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/_index.md#L60-L60"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9eefc81d7903d6418f0c",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Using Grafana Alerting, you create queries and expressions from multiple data sources, no matter where you store your data, giving you the flexibility to combine your data and alert on your metrics and logs in new and unique ways. You can then create, manage, and take action on your alerts from a single, consolidated view, and improve your team's ability to identify and resolve issues quickly.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Overview"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "5d406b86ad9e6e246387efcf33b4df206e2770a4",
        "sha256": "ef0d821f9dfe32acdabb4a24b2a5231deddc6fa20bedf8e1882231f7d19612e4",
        "lineStart": 62,
        "lineEnd": 63,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/_index.md#L62-L63"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c69bc6eca8ceba32f5a1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Pre-provisioned Loki and Prometheus data source-managed alerts have been deprecated in Grafana and can not be created in new stacks. New Grafana stacks will use Grafana-managed alerting (GMA) by default. Datasource-managed alerting (DMA) is not provisioned in new stacks. Existing stacks are not affected.",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9b32eaa130790f906c17a24e6bd9ddb86dad83f3",
        "sha256": "31d12da09ca35461ddafd68db142045a92696caa7a0bbc4405054a84e2a98f89",
        "lineStart": 49,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md#L49-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.084e2d2e0bdfc8d62cbb",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "This applies to the default Loki and Prometheus Grafana Cloud data sources managed by Grafana Labs and Cloud Alertmanager, which will not be available nor will Grafana provision the data source for it. If you add your own Mimir, Loki, or Alertmanager data sources, you can continue to use data source-managed alerts.",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9b32eaa130790f906c17a24e6bd9ddb86dad83f3",
        "sha256": "31d12da09ca35461ddafd68db142045a92696caa7a0bbc4405054a84e2a98f89",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c65ec0e8dbd92e4170a9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Cloud users can import DMA rules into GMA rules with the import tool. See the [import data source-managed alerts to Grafana-managed alerts documentation](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana/latest/alerting/alerting-rules/alerting-migration/) for information on how to do this.",
      "headingPath": [],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9b32eaa130790f906c17a24e6bd9ddb86dad83f3",
        "sha256": "31d12da09ca35461ddafd68db142045a92696caa7a0bbc4405054a84e2a98f89",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.bef0a48e363fdb471dcf",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "An alert rule consists of one or more queries and expressions that select the data you want to measure. It contains a condition to trigger the alert, an evaluation period that determines how often the rule is evaluated, and additional options to manage alert events and their notifications.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure alert rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9b32eaa130790f906c17a24e6bd9ddb86dad83f3",
        "sha256": "31d12da09ca35461ddafd68db142045a92696caa7a0bbc4405054a84e2a98f89",
        "lineStart": 61,
        "lineEnd": 61,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md#L61-L61"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5f7faafd8732ec4c9511",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana supports two types of alert rules:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure alert rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "9b32eaa130790f906c17a24e6bd9ddb86dad83f3",
        "sha256": "31d12da09ca35461ddafd68db142045a92696caa7a0bbc4405054a84e2a98f89",
        "lineStart": 63,
        "lineEnd": 63,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/_index.md#L63-L63"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.520d7682915f704bb04a",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. **Grafana-managed alert rules** — the recommended option. They can query backend data sources—including Prometheus-based ones—and offer a [richer feature set](ref:comparison-ds-grafana-rules).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure alert rules"
      ],
      "source": {
