    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.6218fbce405d518a7f65",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A query offset is applied to each rule. For example, an offset of `1m` adjusts the query's time range to `To: now-1m`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Import data source-managed rules to Grafana-managed rules",
        "How it works"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/alerting-migration.md",
