    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.34ed016b532d6c349889",
      "syntaxRole": "procedural-step",
      "sourceText": "1. When using the `<GRAFANA_BASE_URL>/api/convert/` endpoint, `mimirtool` interacts with Grafana—not with a Mimir instance. In this case, `MIMIR_TENANT_ID` must always be set to `1`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Import data source-managed rules to Grafana-managed rules",
        "Import rules with command-line tools",
        "mimirtool"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/alerting-migration.md",
