      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `GET` and `DELETE` endpoints work only with provisioned and imported alert rules. All `GET` endpoints support both JSON and YAML response formats based on the `Accept` header: use `application/json` for JSON responses, or `application/yaml` for YAML responses. YAML is the default format when no `Accept` header is specified.",
