    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.acf72e2471f0bc5044d3",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Mimir** - use the `/prometheus` prefix. The Prometheus data source supports both Grafana Mimir and Prometheus, and Grafana expects that both the [Query API](/docs/mimir/latest/operators-guide/reference-http-api/#querier--query-frontend) and [Ruler API](/docs/mimir/latest/operators-guide/reference-http-api/#ruler) are under the same URL. You cannot provide a separate URL for the Ruler API.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure data source-managed alert rules",
        "Create data source-managed alert rules",
        "Before you begin",
        "Enable the Ruler API"
      ],
