      "sourceText": "Note that Grafana Alerting only supports fixed relative time ranges, for example, `now-24hr: now`. It doesn't support absolute time ranges: `2021-12-02 00:00:00 to 2021-12-05 23:59:592` or semi-relative time ranges: `now/d to: now`.",
