    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3e4069a116d58634acc2",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For instance, you can create a recording rule generating a new metric, `error_9001_count`, which counts occurrences of a specific log error within one minute. Then, query the `error_9001_count` metric in dashboards and alert rules.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure recording rules"
      ],
