    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9ef35258f58f18952e36",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Faster queries** are needed: Performing heavy aggregations or querying large data sets is quicker with precomputed results than real-time queries.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure recording rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/_index.md",
