    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c396837ea163361050de",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When alert rules query recorded metrics, consider the following recommendations:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure recording rules",
        "Alerting on recorded metrics"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "2cbcd5130654cb70eb0d227becc9037026971198",
        "sha256": "ce98a76ec0407ceb8ed5361a4aaac05dd8dfb1cc41276974affb4f6798051e42",
        "lineStart": 70,
        "lineEnd": 70,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/_index.md#L70-L70"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.4e6fc9beddb8d02b1285",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Use frequent evaluation intervals**. Set frequent evaluation intervals for recording rules. Long intervals, such as an hour, can cause the recorded metric to be stale and lead to misaligned alert rule evaluations, especially when combined with a long pending period.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure recording rules",
        "Alerting on recorded metrics"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "2cbcd5130654cb70eb0d227becc9037026971198",
        "sha256": "ce98a76ec0407ceb8ed5361a4aaac05dd8dfb1cc41276974affb4f6798051e42",
        "lineStart": 72,
        "lineEnd": 72,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/_index.md#L72-L72"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.7c891613c525ff20a648",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Align alert evaluation with recording frequency**. The evaluation interval of an alert rule that depends on a recorded metric should be aligned with the recording rule's interval. If a recording rule runs every 3 minutes, the alert rule should also be evaluated at a similar frequency to ensure it acts on fresh data. For details about the evaluation sequence, refer to [how rules are evaluated within a group](ref:evaluation-within-a-group).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure recording rules",
        "Alerting on recorded metrics"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "2cbcd5130654cb70eb0d227becc9037026971198",
        "sha256": "ce98a76ec0407ceb8ed5361a4aaac05dd8dfb1cc41276974affb4f6798051e42",
        "lineStart": 73,
        "lineEnd": 73,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/_index.md#L73-L73"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.18cc64139d26c2e3c9bd",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Use `_over_time` functions for instant queries**. Since all alert rules are ultimately executed as an instant query, you can use functions like `max_over_time(my_metric[5m])` as an instant query. This allows you to get an aggregated value over a period without using a range query and a reduce expression.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure recording rules",
        "Alerting on recorded metrics"
      ],
      "source": {
