    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c967ac1aed85a693ab3d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "[Recording rules](ref:create-recording-rules) allow you to periodically pre-compute frequently used or computationally expensive queries, saving the results as a new time series metric.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create Grafana-managed recording rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f9fe42d6ef0ea182ebb59f846a4049be0f6f0b1f",
        "sha256": "598873d1bd4b5134833794231ede1bf6eba978d22eed7f14720fcb1d3a996369",
        "lineStart": 44,
        "lineEnd": 44,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md#L44-L44"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9983c461692c886d19b0",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alert rules and dashboards can then query the new metric resulting from the recording rule. This is faster than querying real-time data and can help to reduce system load.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create Grafana-managed recording rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f9fe42d6ef0ea182ebb59f846a4049be0f6f0b1f",
        "sha256": "598873d1bd4b5134833794231ede1bf6eba978d22eed7f14720fcb1d3a996369",
        "lineStart": 46,
        "lineEnd": 46,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md#L46-L46"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9f4eb79dd52e87bce7ef",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana does not contain an embedded time-series database to store recording rule results. You must bring your own Prometheus-compatible database to store the series generated by recording rules.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create Grafana-managed recording rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f9fe42d6ef0ea182ebb59f846a4049be0f6f0b1f",
        "sha256": "598873d1bd4b5134833794231ede1bf6eba978d22eed7f14720fcb1d3a996369",
        "lineStart": 48,
        "lineEnd": 48,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md#L48-L48"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1221c32d891bf5112f36",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana-managed recording rules offer the same Prometheus-like semantics but allow you to query [data sources supported by alerting](ref:alerting-data-sources). Additionally, you can use recording rules to import and map data from other data sources into Prometheus.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create Grafana-managed recording rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f9fe42d6ef0ea182ebb59f846a4049be0f6f0b1f",
        "sha256": "598873d1bd4b5134833794231ede1bf6eba978d22eed7f14720fcb1d3a996369",
        "lineStart": 50,
        "lineEnd": 50,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md#L50-L50"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.339459e59362e86eae07",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana Cloud, recording rules support writing to Prometheus-compatible data sources configured with [Private Data Source Connect](https://grafana.com/docs/grafana-cloud/connect-externally-hosted/private-data-source-connect/) (PDC). This allows you to write recording rule results to a Prometheus or Mimir instance in a private network without opening that network to inbound traffic from Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create Grafana-managed recording rules"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "f9fe42d6ef0ea182ebb59f846a4049be0f6f0b1f",
        "sha256": "598873d1bd4b5134833794231ede1bf6eba978d22eed7f14720fcb1d3a996369",
        "lineStart": 52,
        "lineEnd": 52,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/create-recording-rules/create-grafana-managed-recording-rules.md#L52-L52"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "mixed-edition-statement-requires-review",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a1bb301fce438c7914c1",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana-managed recording rules are enabled by default in Grafana Cloud.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Create Grafana-managed recording rules"
      ],
