    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.17c555f55e1c0299c719",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The **Evaluation interval** of the evaluation group should equal the size of the query window. For example, if your query covers `now-5m: now-4m` (1-minute window with 4-minute delay), use a **1-minute evaluation interval**. This ensures each evaluation produces a new, non-overlapping sample.",
