      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Grafana includes several optional annotations, such as `description`, `summary`, and `runbook_url`, which can be edited in the alert rule. You can also create your custom annotations. For example, you might create a new annotation named `location` to report the location of the system that triggered the alert.",
