    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5a45f9aa4151546be9c9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If you need to print unique labels you should consider changing your alert rules from uni-dimensional to multi-dimensional instead. You can do this by replacing your classic condition with reduce and math expressions.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Labels and annotations template examples",
        "Legacy Alerting templates",
        "Print all labels from a classic condition"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/examples.md",
