    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.0fde691da22ef70ef25d",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To print the value of something, use `{{` and `}}`. You can print the value of a [variable](#variables), a field of a variable, the result of a function, or the value of dot.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting template language",
        "Print"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "702c5f51bce24380913629947d22740ad30a4f84",
        "sha256": "8c9b985ed7518f7d72061c102a01c5ca9cc3017ac1f8fd970fbde652f259e524",
        "lineStart": 54,
        "lineEnd": 54,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md#L54-L54"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ca64aa70f0c9e1820461",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In `text/template`, there is a special cursor called dot, written as `.`. You can think of this cursor as a variable whose value changes depending on where in the template it is used.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting template language",
        "Dot"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "702c5f51bce24380913629947d22740ad30a4f84",
        "sha256": "8c9b985ed7518f7d72061c102a01c5ca9cc3017ac1f8fd970fbde652f259e524",
        "lineStart": 65,
        "lineEnd": 65,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md#L65-L65"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.1df765cbe2aa398b79d8",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "At the start of notification templates, dot (`.`) refers to [Notification Data](ref:reference-notificationdata).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting template language",
        "Dot"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "702c5f51bce24380913629947d22740ad30a4f84",
        "sha256": "8c9b985ed7518f7d72061c102a01c5ca9cc3017ac1f8fd970fbde652f259e524",
        "lineStart": 67,
        "lineEnd": 67,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md#L67-L67"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cf6df31f0348ddaa0343",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In annotation and label templates, dot (`.`) is initialized with all alert data. It’s recommended to use the [`$labels` and `$values` variables](ref:alert-rule-template-reference-variables) instead to directly access the alert labels and query values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting template language",
        "Dot"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "702c5f51bce24380913629947d22740ad30a4f84",
        "sha256": "8c9b985ed7518f7d72061c102a01c5ca9cc3017ac1f8fd970fbde652f259e524",
        "lineStart": 73,
        "lineEnd": 73,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md#L73-L73"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aa81bc0d42e46e51382b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Dot (`.`) might refer to something else when used in a [range](#range), a [with](#with), or when writing [templates](#templates) used in other templates.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Alerting template language",
        "Dot"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "702c5f51bce24380913629947d22740ad30a4f84",
        "sha256": "8c9b985ed7518f7d72061c102a01c5ca9cc3017ac1f8fd970fbde652f259e524",
        "lineStart": 76,
        "lineEnd": 76,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/language.md#L76-L76"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fd4338d228df1e34a7dd",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Annotations and labels in alert rules can be defined using plain text. However, you can also define templates to customize their values with dynamic data from alert rule queries.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 63,
        "lineEnd": 63,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L63-L63"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f826fa67fbe36694ef73",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, you can template the `summary` annotation to include information from query values, providing relevant alert context for responders. Refer to [Template annotations and labels](ref:template-annotations-and-labels) for various use cases.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 65,
        "lineEnd": 65,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L65-L65"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9319cbba9873ffaf9148",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Variables represent dynamic values from alert rule queries that can be displayed or accessed in your templates.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Variables"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 71,
        "lineEnd": 71,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L71-L71"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
