      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3210d8a61cfb51b4bc94",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `$labels` variable contains all labels from the query. It excludes [user-configured and reserved labels](ref:label-types), containing only query labels.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Variables",
        "$labels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 91,
        "lineEnd": 91,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L91-L91"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5a82d87c73ee3339b09a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, suppose you have a query that returns CPU usage for all of your servers, and you have an alert rule that fires when any of your servers have exceeded 80% CPU usage for the last 5 minutes. You want to add a summary annotation to the alert that tells you which server is experiencing high CPU usage. With the `$labels` variable you can write a template that prints a human-readable sentence such as:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Variables",
        "$labels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 95,
        "lineEnd": 95,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L95-L95"
      },
