    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.37cc3c8c91004c4912fc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "> If you are using a classic condition then `$labels` will not contain any labels from the query. Classic conditions discard these labels in order to enforce uni-dimensional behavior (at most one alert per alert rule). If you want to use labels from the query in your template then use the example [here](ref:print-all-labels-from-a-classic-condition).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Variables",
        "$labels"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 107,
        "lineEnd": 107,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L107-L107"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.aa09b6d5a16f1b6202bc",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The `$values` variable is a table containing the labels and floating point values of all instant queries and expressions, indexed by their Ref IDs (e.g, `A`, `B`, `C`, etc.). It does not contain the results of range queries, as they can return hundreds or thousands of rows.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Variables",
        "$values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
