    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.c92c47e539bf4be3cfa9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the alert has the label `instance=server1` and the query returns `81.2345`, the template would print:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Variables",
        "$values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 126,
        "lineEnd": 126,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L126-L126"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5948ace5c7cba2a0ab5a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If the query in Ref ID `A` is a range query rather than an instant query then add a reduce expression with Ref ID `B` and replace `$values.A.Value` with `$values.B.Value`:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Variables",
        "$values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 132,
        "lineEnd": 132,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L132-L132"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.478a442623c687283330",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Alternatively, you can use the `index()` function to retrieve the query value:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Variables",
        "$values"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
