    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.fa982a5fbc1addc8bf27",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For further context on these functions, note that templating in Grafana is based on the [Prometheus template implementation](https://prometheus.io/docs/prometheus/latest/configuration/template_reference/), enabling the use of these functions and Prometheus-like templates for formatting alert messages within Grafana.",
