    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.419a224f932de20b9c2e",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Both notification templates and alert rule templates use the Go templating system. However, the [functions and variables available in notification templates](ref:notification-template-reference) differ from those used in annotations and labels templates, which are described in this documentation.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Differences with notification templates"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 471,
        "lineEnd": 471,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L471-L471"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.ab261284365ed7c286d4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Annotation and label templates operate in the context of an individual alert instance, while notification templates apply to a notification that includes a group of alert(s).",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Differences with notification templates"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 473,
        "lineEnd": 473,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L473-L473"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.2b21e87f7eff7b48c34b",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "For example, notification templates provide the `.Alerts` variable, which includes the list of all firing and resolved alerts in the notification. This variable is not available in alert rule templates, which operate within the context of a single alert instance.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Differences with notification templates"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 475,
        "lineEnd": 475,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L475-L475"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.af1cbc07837790b09be3",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Additionally, you cannot reuse templates for labels and annotations as you can with notification templates. Instead, you need to write each template inline within the label or annotation fields and manually copy them wherever you want to reuse the templates.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Annotation and label template reference",
        "Differences with notification templates"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "b80aed07766070f62d8eedce3416344b40af4f00",
        "sha256": "64915b2a31d68f2710a82fc4f02abe170b8afa85814cfadbf26b40c41c5f2da0",
        "lineStart": 477,
        "lineEnd": 477,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/alerting-rules/templates/reference.md#L477-L477"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5c18decd928b2a60cfc9",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Configuring how, when, and where to send alert notifications is an essential part of your alerting system.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8fa8c5585e0f09d18b39c83e6754530293a6d6b2",
        "sha256": "2c1fb41fba78fea35a9a5e7e31857d22258297f3687fea6bfe71ee3c3682a692",
        "lineStart": 61,
        "lineEnd": 61,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/_index.md#L61-L61"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9b166578a3fa467b1b8a",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "By default, Grafana Alerting provides default notification messages with relevant alert information, so you don't need to configure messages initially. In the alert rule, you need to configure how to forward alerts:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure notifications"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "8fa8c5585e0f09d18b39c83e6754530293a6d6b2",
