      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Each alert (or alert instance) is evaluated by the default policy and subsequently by each child policy. Alerts are routed to the appropriate notification policy by matching alert labels with the policy's label matchers. For further details, refer to [label matching and routing in notification policies](ref:intro-notification-policies).",
