      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Policies are evaluated from top to bottom. If a matching policy is found, the system continues to evaluate its child policies in the order they are displayed. For more details, refer to [notification policies routing](ref:policy-routing).",
