      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana Cloud, the standalone Alertmanager UI is deprecated and no longer available. Manage silences here in the Grafana Alerting UI instead. For details, refer to [Configure Alertmanagers](ref:alertmanager-architecture).",
