    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.9c1ac07547ea29d90257",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If [`.Alert.SilenceURL`](ref:silence-url) doesn’t fit your specific use case, you can also create a custom silence link for your custom templates.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure silences",
        "URL link to a silence form"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/create-silence.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "de5f69c5f966165e5d158e3ae6eb7d57492999df",
        "sha256": "ff597f9ab4f6d6c3ee468bb3541225d07e825bdc5fede70457447577b64db7c0",
        "lineStart": 207,
        "lineEnd": 207,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/create-silence.md#L207-L207"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.3202dc227ecbb7dfd015",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When linking to a silence form, provide the default matching labels and comment via `matcher` and `comment` query parameters. The `matcher` parameter should be in the following format `[label][operator][value]` where the `operator` parameter can be one of the following: `=` (equals, not regular expression), `!=` (not equals, not regular expression), `=~` (equals, regular expression), `!~` (not equals, regular expression). The URL can contain many query parameters with the key `matcher`. For example, to link to silence form with matching labels `severity=critical` & `cluster!~europe-.*` and comment `Silence critical EU alerts`, create a URL `https://mygrafana/alerting/silence/new?matcher=severity%3Dcritical&matcher=cluster!~europe-*&comment=Silence%20critical%20EU%20alert`.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure silences",
        "URL link to a silence form"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/create-silence.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "de5f69c5f966165e5d158e3ae6eb7d57492999df",
        "sha256": "ff597f9ab4f6d6c3ee468bb3541225d07e825bdc5fede70457447577b64db7c0",
        "lineStart": 211,
        "lineEnd": 213,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/create-silence.md#L211-L213"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
