    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.f5cf86dfd3aba5a78f36",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "When `equal` is specified, the inhibition only applies when the source and target alerts have the same value for each listed label. For example, setting `equal: [cluster]` ensures that an alert in one cluster only inhibits alerts in the same cluster.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Inhibition rule schema",
        "The `equal` field"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3030f57a20ca73738b38302be6ed815ab5155afb",
        "sha256": "756dc8fef9a59086b0fc06a046eba9ded48a3a12e3e252479ddbb3dd21e47dc5",
        "lineStart": 117,
        "lineEnd": 117,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md#L117-L117"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.cfc61f0a532a3d768f40",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "If `equal` is omitted, any firing source alert matching `source_matchers` inhibits all matching target alerts regardless of their label values.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Inhibition rule schema",
        "The `equal` field"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3030f57a20ca73738b38302be6ed815ab5155afb",
        "sha256": "756dc8fef9a59086b0fc06a046eba9ded48a3a12e3e252479ddbb3dd21e47dc5",
        "lineStart": 119,
        "lineEnd": 119,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md#L119-L119"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.53a13a6afc5237371580",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "The following example defines an inhibition rule that suppresses all `warning`-severity alerts in a cluster when a `critical`-severity alert is already firing for the same cluster.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Example: suppress warning alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3030f57a20ca73738b38302be6ed815ab5155afb",
        "sha256": "756dc8fef9a59086b0fc06a046eba9ded48a3a12e3e252479ddbb3dd21e47dc5",
        "lineStart": 125,
        "lineEnd": 125,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md#L125-L125"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.219850b3818705cfaa67",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The _source_ matcher selects `critical` alerts. When one fires, the rule becomes active.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Example: suppress warning alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3030f57a20ca73738b38302be6ed815ab5155afb",
        "sha256": "756dc8fef9a59086b0fc06a046eba9ded48a3a12e3e252479ddbb3dd21e47dc5",
        "lineStart": 138,
        "lineEnd": 138,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md#L138-L138"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e0a4f0bb09ec0d777254",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- The _target_ matcher selects `warning` alerts. The rule suppresses these while the source alert fires.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Example: suppress warning alerts"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
