    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.d29f2617801afa644c07",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "An Alertmanager can serve multiple routing trees: the default Grafana-managed route and any routes imported from Prometheus Alertmanager or Mimir configurations. Inhibition rules behave differently depending on how each rule is created:",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Inhibition rules and managed routes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3030f57a20ca73738b38302be6ed815ab5155afb",
        "sha256": "756dc8fef9a59086b0fc06a046eba9ded48a3a12e3e252479ddbb3dd21e47dc5",
        "lineStart": 144,
        "lineEnd": 144,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md#L144-L144"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5cbf56031f173786931e",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Grafana-managed rules** are created through the API and apply across the entire Alertmanager. They can match alerts handled by any route, including imported routes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Inhibition rules and managed routes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3030f57a20ca73738b38302be6ed815ab5155afb",
        "sha256": "756dc8fef9a59086b0fc06a046eba9ded48a3a12e3e252479ddbb3dd21e47dc5",
        "lineStart": 146,
        "lineEnd": 146,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md#L146-L146"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.49890d9cb9268e55f80d",
      "syntaxRole": "list-item",
      "sourceText": "- **Imported rules** come from an imported Alertmanager configuration and are scoped to the alerts handled by their imported route. Grafana adds an internal label matcher that limits each imported rule to its own imported route, so an imported rule can't suppress alerts that flow through other routes.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Inhibition rules and managed routes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3030f57a20ca73738b38302be6ed815ab5155afb",
        "sha256": "756dc8fef9a59086b0fc06a046eba9ded48a3a12e3e252479ddbb3dd21e47dc5",
        "lineStart": 147,
        "lineEnd": 147,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md#L147-L147"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.5b889b9a25d7183e96c7",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "To suppress alerts across multiple imported configurations, create a Grafana-managed rule through the API instead of relying on the inhibition rules embedded in an imported configuration.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure inhibition rules",
        "Inhibition rules and managed routes"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "3030f57a20ca73738b38302be6ed815ab5155afb",
        "sha256": "756dc8fef9a59086b0fc06a046eba9ded48a3a12e3e252479ddbb3dd21e47dc5",
        "lineStart": 149,
        "lineEnd": 149,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/inhibition-rules.md#L149-L149"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.a54977e2ed10b6a9c0c4",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "Use contact points to specify where to receive alert notifications. Contact points contain the configuration for sending alert notifications, including destinations like email, Slack, IRM, webhooks, and their notification messages.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure contact points"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/manage-contact-points/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ef54330ce46044eb3d8fa331ad821d7c4ed60e90",
        "sha256": "d99f6d3689581d37677cd6b344dcf2ae66e5c264584a2a17fde824cffac771f6",
        "lineStart": 128,
        "lineEnd": 128,
        "url": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/grafana/grafana/6193dc03311b631b9727b560d24369e683dc396e/docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/manage-contact-points/_index.md#L128-L128"
      },
      "applicability": {
        "status": "oss-labelled-source-candidate-not-yet-reviewed",
        "products": [
          "cloud",
          "enterprise",
          "oss"
        ]
      },
      "atomicity": "unreviewed-may-require-splitting-or-deduplication",
      "acceptanceContract": null,
      "verificationStatus": "not-tested"
    },
    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.dbd10aef0304ea09a0ea",
      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "A contact point can have one or multiple destinations, known as [contact point integrations](#supported-contact-point-integrations). Alert notifications are sent to each integration within the chosen contact point.",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure contact points"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/manage-contact-points/_index.md",
        "gitBlobSha": "ef54330ce46044eb3d8fa331ad821d7c4ed60e90",
