      "syntaxRole": "declarative-or-imperative-paragraph",
      "sourceText": "In Grafana OSS and Grafana Enterprise, you can use a webhook contact point to send alerts to [Grafana IRM](ref:irm). Grafana IRM can then route alerts based on escalation chains for your team's workflows.",
