      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| URL                 | The URL of the REST API of your Jira instance. Supported versions: `2` and `3` (e.g., `https://your-domain.atlassian.net/rest/api/3`). This field is [protected](ref:configure-contact-points) from modification in Grafana Cloud.     |",
