    {
      "id": "grafana.candidate.e63b82dcce3629c0917e",
      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Priority                | The priority level of the issue (e.g., `Low`, `Medium`, `High`, `Critical`). <br>Ensure that the priority value matches the available options for your Jira instance. You can customize priority levels in Jira [here](https://support.atlassian.com/jira-cloud-administration/docs/configure-priorities/).           |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Jira for Alerting",
        "Configure Jira for a contact point",
        "Optional Settings"
      ],
      "source": {
        "path": "docs/sources/alerting/configure-notifications/manage-contact-points/integrations/configure-jira.md",
