      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Reopen Duration         | The time duration (in minutes) to control whether to reopen an issue that was closed within this duration or create a new one. If not specified, the most recent issue that matches the deduplication key will be updated and reopened (if reopen transition is specified).                                           |",
      "headingPath": [
        "Configure Jira for Alerting",
