      "syntaxRole": "table-row",
      "sourceText": "| Message                  | Depends on the **Message format** option. <br/> In `json` format, defines only the `message` field of the [default JSON payload](#default-json-payload). <br/> In `text` format, defines the [entire custom payload](#custom-payload). <br/> This field supports [notification templates](ref:notification-templates). |",
