      "sourceText": "You can customize the `title` and `body` of the Slack message using [notification templates](ref:notification-templates); however, you cannot modify its visual appearance with custom blocks. Additional optional settings are available to customize bot appearance, mentions, and message formatting. Refer to the [Optional settings](#optional-settings) section for more details.",
